('aaa61579-b4a3-5ecc-96c8-0da490207a33','41d8b9a7-03ff-5db5-983e-3936d7ab5c09',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of teaching or being taught the skills for a particular job or activity','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'آموزش، تمرین؛ آموزش (کار)؛ آموزش (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody/provide training Employees should also be given adequate training in fire safety precautions.','receive/have/undergo training A small group would receive intensive training, and then would train others.','need/require training The team will need extra software training.','a training course/programme All staff are invited to take any training course at company expense.','a training session Make sure you attend the computer training sessions.','a training manual She has written a training manual for social workers.','on-the-job training (= while doing a job rather than in a classroom ) On-the-job training was seen as more important than formal education.','in-service training (= while working for an employer ) Most employees take advantage of our in-service training program.','formal training Vaughan had no formal training in art.','staff training Insufficient priority is given to staff training.','teacher training Applications for postgraduate teacher training have increased by nearly 50%.','job/vocational training The college provides vocational training for nurses and theatre technicians.','basic training All navy cooks undergo basic training as sailors.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"On the course we received training in every aspect of the job.","translation":"در دوره آموزشی در هر جنبه از کار آموزش دیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553296.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police drivers have to undergo intensive training .","translation":"رانندگان پلیس باید تحت آموزش های فشرده باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612981.mp3"},{"sentence":"a rigorous training session","translation":"یک جلسه تمرینی سخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845776.mp3"},{"sentence":"On-the job training will be supplemented by classroom lectures.","translation":"آموزش حین کار با سخنرانی های کلاسی تکمیل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845779.mp3"},{"sentence":"The shop opens late on Fridays because of staff training .","translation":"فروشگاه به دلیل آموزش پرسنل جمعه ها دیر باز می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845782.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('bde4632a-6a82-55aa-b813-a61c32e92a84','41d8b9a7-03ff-5db5-983e-3936d7ab5c09',2,null,null,'spoken & written','physical exercises that you do to stay healthy or prepare for a competition','[ uncountable ]',null,'تمرینات بدنی که برای سالم ماندن یا آماده شدن برای مسابقه انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give somebody/provide training Employees should also be given adequate training in fire safety precautions.','receive/have/undergo training A small group would receive intensive training, and then would train others.','need/require training The team will need extra software training.','a training course/programme All staff are invited to take any training course at company expense.','a training session Make sure you attend the computer training sessions.','a training manual She has written a training manual for social workers.','on-the-job training (= while doing a job rather than in a classroom ) On-the-job training was seen as more important than formal education.','in-service training (= while working for an employer ) Most employees take advantage of our in-service training program.','formal training Vaughan had no formal training in art.','staff training Insufficient priority is given to staff training.','teacher training Applications for postgraduate teacher training have increased by nearly 50%.','job/vocational training The college provides vocational training for nurses and theatre technicians.','basic training All navy cooks undergo basic training as sailors.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lesley does weight training twice a week.","translation":"لسلی دو بار در هفته تمرینات با وزنه انجام می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553303.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s in training for the Olympics.","translation":"او در حال تمرین برای المپیک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612982.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('52eafddb-0875-501e-b11b-076b9869c69a','b609ba78-7c54-515c-93f2-7d28967389c6',1,'move to different place etc','حرکت به مکان های مختلف و غیره','spoken & written','to move from one place, school, job etc to another, or to make someone do this, especially within the same organization','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'انتقال دادن؛ جابجا کردن (کارمند)؛ واگذاری (حق)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Swod transferred from MI6 to the Security Service.","translation":"Swod از MI6 به ​​سرویس امنیتی منتقل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613517.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’re transferring him to a special unit at Great Ormond Street Hospital.","translation":"آنها او را به یک واحد ویژه در بیمارستان گریت اورموند استریت منتقل می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553916.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ll be transferred to the Birmingham office.","translation":"شما به دفتر بیرمنگام منتقل خواهید شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001839966.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bcc58962-2da0-52f0-99b6-b630f79bcd2b','b609ba78-7c54-515c-93f2-7d28967389c6',2,'put something in different place','چیزی را در جای دیگری قرار دهید','formal','to move from one place to another, or to move something from one place to another','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'جابجایی از جایی به جای دیگر یا انتقال چیزی از جایی به جای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The exhibition transfers to York City Art Gallery on 23rd January.","translation":"نمایشگاه در 23 ژانویه به گالری هنر شهر یورک منتقل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613522.mp3"},{"sentence":"Transfer the meat to warm plates.","translation":"گوشت را به بشقاب های گرم منتقل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553925.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('fe517d00-a1c6-5c99-8ff1-ad27da0d5f89','b609ba78-7c54-515c-93f2-7d28967389c6',3,'sports person','فرد ورزشی','spoken & written','to sell a sports player to another team','[ transitive ]',null,'برای فروش یک بازیکن ورزشی به تیم دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was transferred for a fee of £8 million.","translation":"او با مبلغ 8 میلیون پوند منتقل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020295.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('820e1b70-572e-5669-a331-45073be4fdea','b609ba78-7c54-515c-93f2-7d28967389c6',4,'money','پول','spoken & written','to move money from one account or institution to another','[ transitive ]',null,'برای انتقال پول از یک حساب یا موسسه به حساب دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’d like to transfer $500 to my checking account.","translation":"من می خواهم 500 دلار به حساب جاری خود منتقل کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553932.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
