('4cd4a42a-0bd9-5032-b210-83dad7fb443e','eaf20ac1-ebb6-51ea-915b-c09a38e81bea',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who you work or do business with',null,null,'کسی که با او کار یا تجارت می کنید',array['colleague']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"one of his business associates","translation":"یکی از همکاران تجاری او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000924386.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('da6a397f-cc7e-5d3b-b34f-d5f0bc512fa0','625ab6ef-473b-52da-81c7-a2cea92846b0',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'associate member/director/head etc',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4c7430a4-0299-51e1-a36f-c730c5f5b6ee','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',1,'listen/look/think carefully','گوش دادن / نگاه / با دقت فکر کنید','spoken & written','when you carefully listen to, look at, or think about someone or something','[ uncountable ]',null,'توجه، دقت؛ توجه (رسانه‌ای)؛ ادب و احترام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"My attention wasn’t really on the game.","translation":"توجه من واقعا به بازی نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659970.mp3"},{"sentence":"She tried to pay attention to what he was saying.","translation":"سعی کرد به حرف های او توجه کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659968.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you paid more attention in class, you might actually learn something!","translation":"اگر در کلاس توجه بیشتری می کردید، ممکن است در واقع چیزی یاد بگیرید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659969.mp3"},{"sentence":"Scott sat down at his desk and turned his attention to the file he had in front of him.","translation":"اسکات پشت میزش نشست و توجهش را به پرونده ای که جلویش داشت معطوف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659976.mp3"},{"sentence":"As a society we need to give more attention to the needs of older people.","translation":"به عنوان یک جامعه باید به نیازهای سالمندان توجه بیشتری داشته باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913506.mp3"},{"sentence":"Now he’s gone, I can give you my undivided attention .","translation":"اکنون او رفته است، من می توانم توجه بی دریغ خود را به شما جلب کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997123.mp3"},{"sentence":"This game is fun and is sure to keep the attention of any young student.","translation":"این بازی سرگرم کننده است و مطمئناً توجه هر دانش آموز جوانی را به خود جلب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659990.mp3"},{"sentence":"They listened to the speech with close attention .","translation":"آنها با دقت به سخنرانی گوش دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913512.mp3"},{"sentence":"Attention to detail is essential in this job.","translation":"توجه به جزئیات در این شغل ضروری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659994.mp3"},{"sentence":"During the lecture Sarah’s attention began to wander .","translation":"در طول سخنرانی، توجه سارا شروع به سرگردانی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001913524.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('e23bea60-6cec-59e4-83a0-e8aa52f783a6','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',2,'interest','علاقه','spoken & written','the interest that people show in someone or something','[ plural, uncountable ]',null,'علاقه ای که مردم به کسی یا چیزی نشان می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was flattered by all the attention he was giving her.","translation":"او از تمام توجهی که او به او می کرد، متملق شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997130.mp3"},{"sentence":"a player who quickly attracted the attention of several clubs","translation":"بازیکنی که به سرعت مورد توجه چندین باشگاه قرار گرفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660019.mp3"},{"sentence":"The exhibition received little attention in the press.","translation":"این نمایشگاه در مطبوعات مورد توجه کمی قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660010.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her case attracted a great deal of media attention.","translation":"پرونده او توجه رسانه ها را به خود جلب کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660013.mp3"},{"sentence":"The book holds the reader’s attention right to the very end.","translation":"کتاب تا انتها توجه خواننده را به خود جلب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941455.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rob loves being the centre of attention (= the person who everyone is interested in, listens to etc ) .","translation":"راب دوست دارد در مرکز توجه باشد (= شخصی که همه به او علاقه دارند، به او گوش می دهند و غیره).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660014.mp3"},{"sentence":"She spent a lot of time trying to avoid the attentions (= romantic interest ) of her boss.","translation":"او زمان زیادی را صرف کرد تا از توجه (= علاقه عاشقانه) رئیس خود دوری کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660020.mp3"},{"sentence":"The man then turned his attentions to (= became romantically interested in ) her sister.","translation":"سپس مرد توجه خود را به خواهرش معطوف کرد (= به طور عاشقانه به او علاقه مند شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941456.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('37f43021-eef3-5c44-a9d0-8734a1279c65','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',3,'notice','اطلاع دهید','spoken & written','to make someone notice you, especially because you want to speak to them or you need their help',null,null,'تا کسی متوجه شما شود، به خصوص به این دلیل که می خواهید با او صحبت کنید یا به کمک او نیاز دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She waved to attract the attention of the waitress.","translation":"برای جلب توجه پیشخدمت دست تکان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997157.mp3"},{"sentence":"Children often misbehave in order to get attention.","translation":"کودکان اغلب برای جلب توجه بد رفتار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997167.mp3"},{"sentence":"The purpose of the article was to draw attention to the problems faced by single parents.","translation":"هدف این مقاله جلب توجه به مشکلاتی بود که والدین مجرد با آن روبرو هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997172.mp3"},{"sentence":"We wanted to focus public attention on this matter.","translation":"ما می خواستیم توجه عمومی را روی این موضوع متمرکز کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660028.mp3"},{"sentence":"He left quietly to avoid drawing attention to himself.","translation":"بی سر و صدا رفت تا توجه را به خودش جلب نکند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660029.mp3"},{"sentence":"All this talk of war is just an attempt to draw attention away from the serious economic problems that face our country.","translation":"همه این صحبت ها از جنگ فقط تلاشی برای دور کردن توجه از مشکلات جدی اقتصادی است که کشور ما با آن مواجه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660030.mp3"},{"sentence":"The matter was first brought to my attention earlier this year.","translation":"این موضوع برای اولین بار در اوایل سال جاری مورد توجه من قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997181.mp3"},{"sentence":"It came to my attention that Jenny was claiming overtime pay for hours she had not worked.","translation":"متوجه شدم که جنی برای ساعاتی که کار نکرده بود ادعای اضافه کاری می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660031.mp3"},{"sentence":"This fact had not escaped the attention of the authorities.","translation":"این واقعیت از توجه مسئولان دور نمانده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941465.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('e50d3632-7b70-59d5-a020-1aa5651e2c46','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',4,'repair/cleaning','تعمیر / تمیز کردن','spoken & written','something you do to repair or clean something','[ uncountable ]',null,'کاری که برای تعمیر یا تمیز کردن چیزی انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bike’s in fairly good condition, but the gears need a bit of attention .","translation":"دوچرخه در وضعیت نسبتا خوبی است، اما دنده ها نیاز به کمی توجه دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660047.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ad899f3e-be58-518c-8485-f7e43c3b03e7','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',5,'care','مراقبت','spoken & written','things that you do to help or to take care of someone or something','[ uncountable ]',null,'کارهایی که برای کمک یا مراقبت از کسی یا چیزی انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Pets need a lot of care and attention .","translation":"حیوانات خانگی نیاز به مراقبت و توجه زیادی دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000997204.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anyone who comes into contact with these chemicals should seek urgent medical attention .","translation":"هر کسی که با این مواد شیمیایی تماس پیدا می کند باید فورا به دنبال مراقبت های پزشکی باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941466.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your plants look like they could do with a bit of attention .","translation":"گیاهان شما به نظر می رسد که می توانند با کمی توجه انجام دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660057.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('42ac7441-dcb6-533a-b8c5-5732ba483fe6','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'stand to/at attention','توجه، دقت؛ توجه (رسانه‌ای)؛ ادب و احترام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('1b8a7b54-72c3-5717-b6f6-434f4dd5ff07','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'attention!','توجه، دقت؛ توجه (رسانه‌ای)؛ ادب و احترام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('62b70cd8-f145-5322-a5e9-95e3a7a620d3','0bb558dd-4d36-5ee6-9ae1-4052e12a7320',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'for the attention of somebody','توجه، دقت؛ توجه (رسانه‌ای)؛ ادب و احترام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay attention to something/somebody He read the final page, paying particular attention to the last paragraph.','turn your attention to something/somebody She quickly put away the shopping and then turned her attention to preparing dinner.','give something/somebody your attention (= think about something or someone so that you can deal with a problem ) She promised to give the matter her attention the next day.','somebody’s attention wanders (= someone stops listening, watching etc carefully ) During the service, her mind began to wander.','somebody’s full/complete/undivided attention He gave the task his undivided attention.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c14e1ea8-53ff-5aba-a45b-d15c726b0028','fe4f26e9-d2fc-56a5-b193-753209424e71',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to ask people to listen to important information that is being announced , especially on a loudspeaker (= piece of equipment used to make sounds louder )',null,null,'برای درخواست از مردم برای گوش دادن به اطلاعات مهمی که اعلام می شود، به خصوص در بلندگو (= قطعه ای از تجهیزات مورد استفاده برای بلندتر کردن صداها) استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Attention, please! Could passenger Marie Thomas please proceed to Gate 25 immediately.","translation":"توجه، لطفا! آیا مسافر ماری توماس لطفاً فوراً به دروازه 25 بروید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660069.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dce0b103-868c-571f-b030-12f803d7c771','618d3012-60af-5cd8-8efc-29363a616394',1,'power','قدرت','spoken & written','the power you have because of your official position','[ uncountable ]',null,'اختیار، صلاحیت؛ مرجع؛ مقام‌ها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have authority Teachers should have the authority to discipline their students. He has no authority over us anymore.','exercise/exert your authority ( also wield authority formal ) (= use your authority ) In practice it’s very difficult for the president to exercise his authority. He was one of those people who want to wield authority over others.','abuse/misuse your authority (= use your authority in a bad way ) The mayor was accused of abusing his authority and taking bribes.','establish/assert/impose/stamp your authority (= show people that you have authority ) The new manager was anxious to establish her authority. Robertson quickly stamped his authority on the team. The State Department pressed him to take bolder steps to assert his authority.','lose your authority He’s worried that he is losing his authority over the party.','undermine/weaken somebody’s authority (= make someone’s authority weaker ) I wasn’t trying to undermine your authority.','exceed/overstep your authority (= do more than you have the power or right to do ) A higher court decided that the judge had exceeded his authority.','challenge somebody’s authority (= try to take the power away from someone ) There had been no-one to really challenge his authority.','full/complete/total authority The manager has full authority to make decisions.','absolute authority (= complete authority over everyone – used especially about the leader of a country ) In those days, the emperor had absolute authority.','parental authority The younger children are more likely to resist parental authority.','governmental authority Their failure undermined governmental authority.','presidential authority A number of constitutional amendments have increased presidential authority.','legal authority US agents have legal authority to bring criminals back from overseas.','be in a position of authority I’ve never been in a position of authority before.','have an air of authority approving (= look like you have authority, in a way that makes people obey you ) The commander had an unmistakeable air of authority.','a challenge to somebody’s authority The leadership saw the demonstrations as a challenge to their authority.','an authority figure (= someone, such as a parent or teacher, who has the power to tell young people what they can do ) The teacher is an authority figure, like the parent.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Only the president has the authority to declare war.","translation":"فقط رئیس جمهور صلاحیت اعلام جنگ را دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000125.mp3"},{"sentence":"Several countries claim authority over the islands.","translation":"چندین کشور ادعای اقتدار بر این جزایر را دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660449.mp3"},{"sentence":"I need to speak to someone in authority (= who has a position of power ) .","translation":"من باید با کسی که دارای قدرت است صحبت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000126.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b70b4add-b035-5a0e-bb16-a70bc20d10e7','618d3012-60af-5cd8-8efc-29363a616394',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the authorities','اختیار، صلاحیت؛ مرجع؛ مقام‌ها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have authority Teachers should have the authority to discipline their students. He has no authority over us anymore.','exercise/exert your authority ( also wield authority formal ) (= use your authority ) In practice it’s very difficult for the president to exercise his authority. He was one of those people who want to wield authority over others.','abuse/misuse your authority (= use your authority in a bad way ) The mayor was accused of abusing his authority and taking bribes.','establish/assert/impose/stamp your authority (= show people that you have authority ) The new manager was anxious to establish her authority. Robertson quickly stamped his authority on the team. The State Department pressed him to take bolder steps to assert his authority.','lose your authority He’s worried that he is losing his authority over the party.','undermine/weaken somebody’s authority (= make someone’s authority weaker ) I wasn’t trying to undermine your authority.','exceed/overstep your authority (= do more than you have the power or right to do ) A higher court decided that the judge had exceeded his authority.','challenge somebody’s authority (= try to take the power away from someone ) There had been no-one to really challenge his authority.','full/complete/total authority The manager has full authority to make decisions.','absolute authority (= complete authority over everyone – used especially about the leader of a country ) In those days, the emperor had absolute authority.','parental authority The younger children are more likely to resist parental authority.','governmental authority Their failure undermined governmental authority.','presidential authority A number of constitutional amendments have increased presidential authority.','legal authority US agents have legal authority to bring criminals back from overseas.','be in a position of authority I’ve never been in a position of authority before.','have an air of authority approving (= look like you have authority, in a way that makes people obey you ) The commander had an unmistakeable air of authority.','a challenge to somebody’s authority The leadership saw the demonstrations as a challenge to their authority.','an authority figure (= someone, such as a parent or teacher, who has the power to tell young people what they can do ) The teacher is an authority figure, like the parent.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
