('e762a501-3195-548f-a0c3-72709cda0fbf','349d1139-342c-5971-a089-eb4da0d4eca4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the meal you have in the morning',null,null,'صبحانه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have/eat breakfast Paul got up, washed and had breakfast.','have something for breakfast What do you usually have for breakfast?','a big breakfast Most people don’t eat a big breakfast nowadays.','a good/proper breakfast (= big and healthy ) I think kids need a good breakfast before they go to school.','a hearty breakfast written (= big ) The price includes a hearty breakfast.','a small/light breakfast She ate a light breakfast of toast and coffee.','an English/a full breakfast (= a big breakfast with bacon, egg, toast etc – used especially in hotels ) A lot of people like to have an English breakfast on holiday.','a cooked/fried breakfast (= bacon, egg, toast etc ) Do you feel like having a cooked breakfast?','a buffet breakfast (= one in a hotel, where you serve yourself ) A buffet breakfast is served in the hotel''s elegant dining room.','a continental breakfast (= coffee and bread with butter and jam ) Continental breakfast can be served in your room.','a quick/hasty/hurried breakfast I grabbed a quick breakfast and ran to the bus stop.','a long/leisurely breakfast (= not hurried ) On Sunday mornings I like to have a leisurely breakfast.','an early/late breakfast We had an early breakfast and left before 7.30.','a working breakfast (= at which you talk about business ) She suggested we meet at 8.30 for a working breakfast.','the breakfast dishes Did you put the breakfast dishes in the dishwasher?','the breakfast things (= dishes, packets etc ) Dad was clearing the breakfast things away.','a breakfast table/room The house has a large kitchen and a breakfast room.','breakfast cereal Many breakfast cereals are high in sugar.','breakfast time I don’t like talking at breakfast time.','breakfast television/TV (= programmes on television in the early morning ) The children all eat their cereal in front of breakfast television.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We had bacon and eggs for breakfast .","translation":"برای صبحانه بیکن و تخم مرغ خوردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000905621.mp3"},{"sentence":"I never eat breakfast .","translation":"من هیچ وقت صبحانه نمیخورم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001699183.mp3"},{"sentence":"After a hearty breakfast (= large breakfast ) , we set out for a hike.","translation":"بعد از یک صبحانه مقوی (= صبحانه بزرگ) عازم پیاده روی شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001699187.mp3"},{"sentence":"a light breakfast (= small breakfast )","translation":"یک صبحانه سبک (= صبحانه کوچک)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001699192.mp3"},{"sentence":"a working breakfast (= a breakfast at which you talk about business )","translation":"صبحانه کاری (= صبحانه ای که در آن در مورد تجارت صحبت می کنید)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001699196.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('992081e3-0289-58b2-85ef-646afb3454de','6d332ce0-7c80-5023-bd89-c254f438db07',1,'bright','روشن','spoken & written','brilliant light or colour is very bright and strong',null,null,'درخشان، بسیار روشن؛ فوق‌العاده باهوش؛ عالی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She closed her eyes against the brilliant light .","translation":"چشمانش را در برابر نور درخشان بست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677567.mp3"},{"sentence":"We sat outside in the brilliant sunshine .","translation":"بیرون زیر آفتاب درخشان نشستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677571.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was dressed in brilliant white.","translation":"او لباس سفید درخشان پوشیده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677575.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6cae02b2-229d-5cc5-b6fe-0ff4dca4df82','6d332ce0-7c80-5023-bd89-c254f438db07',2,'clever','باهوش','spoken & written','extremely clever or skilful',null,null,'بسیار باهوش یا ماهرانه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I think that’s a brilliant idea .","translation":"من فکر می کنم این یک ایده درخشان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677577.mp3"},{"sentence":"a brilliant performance","translation":"یک اجرای درخشان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001037970.mp3"},{"sentence":"a brilliant young musician","translation":"یک نوازنده جوان باهوش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677581.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
