('66121139-d932-5143-a52d-19d3e9d4ae9d','e08f6257-d1ba-5ddb-a86e-5ca7c213f75e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the period of time when you are a child',null,'second childhood','کودکی، دوران طفولیت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['happy/unhappy Her parents divorced and her childhood was unhappy.','normal I think my childhood was fairly normal.','lonely He had no brothers or sisters and a lonely childhood.','a deprived childhood (= without enough money, food, attention etc ) Many children living in these areas have very deprived childhoods.','early/late childhood Experiences in early childhood are very important.','have a happy/unhappy etc childhood I wish I''d had a happy childhood like yours.','spend your childhood This is the house where the artist spent most of his childhood.','remember something from (your) childhood He remembered the place from his childhood.','childhood memories The smell in the air brought back happy childhood memories.','a childhood friend He married his childhood friend.','somebody''s childhood home Her childhood home was in North Dakota.','a childhood experience Our childhood experiences make us who we are.','a childhood illness/disease measles and other common childhood illnesses']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had a very happy childhood.","translation":"کودکی بسیار شادی داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000883025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most infections occur in childhood.","translation":"بیشتر عفونت ها در دوران کودکی رخ می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675676.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had been writing poems since her childhood.","translation":"او از کودکی شعر می سرود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675677.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('43830cde-41cd-5e53-9904-cf3a4c10facf','c5566bb7-fb91-500d-a2c2-2a45eade25d4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a sweet brown food that you can eat as a sweet or use in cooking to give foods such as cakes a special sweet taste','[ uncountable ]',null,'شکلات، شکلات‌دار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['milk chocolate (= chocolate with milk added to it ) ice-cream inside a milk chocolate coating','dark chocolate ( also plain chocolate British English ) (= without milk and with very little sugar ) strawberries dipped in dark chocolate','white chocolate (= white in colour, with a sweet milky taste ) Serve the cake with a white chocolate sauce.','bitter chocolate (= dark chocolate with a strong sharp taste ) Bitter chocolate may be added to meat sauces for extra flavour.','cooking chocolate (= chocolate to use in cooking ) Melt the cooking chocolate and spread it over the tray.','melted chocolate Stir in the eggs and the melted chocolate.','a bar of chocolate (= a long block of chocolate ) He bought a Coke and a bar of chocolate.','a piece/bit of chocolate Would you like a piece of chocolate?','a box of chocolates (= a box of small sweets covered with chocolate ) I gave Mum a box of chocolates for her birthday.','a slab of chocolate (= a large flat piece ) They shared a large slab of chocolate.','a square of chocolate (= a small square piece ) I only ate one small square of chocolate.','a chocolate cake/biscuit/pudding etc For her birthday he made a chocolate cake.','chocolate chips (= very small pieces of chocolate ) vanilla ice cream with chocolate chips','a chocolate factory My dream job would be working in a chocolate factory.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a chocolate bar","translation":"یک تخته شکلات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000884099.mp3"},{"sentence":"a chocolate cake","translation":"یک کیک شکلاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691501.mp3"},{"sentence":"a packet of chocolate biscuits","translation":"یک بسته بیسکویت شکلاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691502.mp3"},{"sentence":"I prefer milk chocolate to dark chocolate .","translation":"من شکلات شیری را به شکلات تلخ ترجیح می دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691503.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
