('a450e58a-192c-5de4-8b32-aa9a34a8c3e9','d0a2a2a0-999d-548f-abb4-405ec2c3e574',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a room that you have lessons in at a school or college',null,null,'کلاس، اتاق درس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('30f8c15c-f583-5b10-9fcb-7d473e3ff902','3ad9dc0e-fb6e-5588-a1a5-b12a55dd389d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone you work with – used especially by professional people',null,null,'همکار، همکار کاری',array['co-worker']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a colleague of mine from the bank","translation":"یکی از همکارانم از بانک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000871134.mp3"},{"sentence":"She discussed the idea with some of her colleagues.","translation":"او این ایده را با تعدادی از همکارانش در میان گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680293.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('317b519f-26e9-5503-a551-58a061ab9f55','ef5c4ad3-bf6a-586f-9021-504c122aa420',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people chosen to do a particular job, make decisions etc','[ countable ]',null,'کمیته، هیئت‌نمایندگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a committee meets (= has a meeting ) The environmental health committee will meet again next Wednesday.','be on a committee (= be a member of a committee ) I was on the parents'' committee at my kids'' school.','serve/sit on a committee (= be a member of an important committee ) Our organization is always in need of volunteers to serve on the committee.','chair a committee (= be the person in charge of a committee ) Professor Peacock was appointed to chair the committee.','appoint/set up/form a committee The council appointed a special committee to study the issue.','join a committee I was invited to join a committee to plan the summer carnival.','leave a committee After three years, she decided to leave the committee.','stand down from a committee (= leave it ) Everyone was sorry when he stood down from the committee.','a committee meeting There''s a committee meeting once a month.','a committee member Four committee members did not attend the meeting.','the committee chairman/chair There will be a new committee chairman next year.','a special committee A special committee of scientists was set up to study the disease.','an executive committee (= that manages an organization and makes decisions for it ) He sat on the firm''s Executive Committee.','an advisory committee a government advisory committee','a standing committee (= a permanent one )','a joint committee (= involving two or more groups )','a steering committee (= one that directs a particular activity )','a select committee (= one of politicians and advisers who look at a particular subject )','a management committee The scheme will be overseen by a management committee.','a government/departmental/ministerial committee','a planning committee British English (= one that considers requests to build new buildings ) Several concerns were raised at the planning committee.','the finance/education etc committee']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the International Committee of the Red Cross","translation":"کمیته بین المللی صلیب سرخ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668932.mp3"},{"sentence":"a ministerial committee on security affairs","translation":"کمیته وزارتی در امور امنیتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668935.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s on the finance committee.","translation":"او در کمیته مالی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668936.mp3"},{"sentence":"a committee meeting","translation":"یک جلسه کمیته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668942.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('a309880e-2c9e-5702-a1b0-2eebfe0e9bc8','36f741e4-9f10-5b7d-8ba3-e5ecd88f3e8f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the people who live in the same area, town etc','[ countable ]',null,'اجتماع، جامعه؛ جمعیت محلی؛ شورای محل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the local community Our school is the centre of the local community.','the whole community The committee meets to discuss issues that affect the whole community.','a small/large community 75% of the population live in small communities of fewer than 450 people.','the wider community (= the community of which a small group is a part ) The sports centre is available to both the university and the wider community.','a rural community (= a community in a country area ) There is a need for better public transport for people in rural communities.','a village community Outside the capital, most people live in village communities.','a farming community a small farming community of about 1,000 inhabitants','a mining community She was brought up in a small mining community in North Wales.','a close/close-knit/tight-knit community (= where all the people know each other ) I live in a close-knit community where there''s lots of support.','a thriving community (= a community which is successful ) In the past the village was a thriving community with a number of shops.','a community centre British English , community center American English (= where people can go for social events, classes etc ) A community centre is the ideal place for local residents to get together to discuss crime prevention.','a community group Community groups do not have enough say over what is built in their neighbourhoods.','a community leader Community leaders meet regularly to discuss local problems.','community services (= providing schools, health facilities, roads etc ) Some tax goes towards paying for your community services.','community relations Poor community relations are more common in urban areas than in the rest of the country.','community spirit (= wanting to give friendship and support to other people who live in the same community ) There is great community spirit in the village where I live.','community care (= care for the sick, the old etc in their community rather than in hospital ) Several voluntary organizations are involved in providing community care.','community education Community education includes classes, workshops, and summer schools.','a member of a community It''s good to feel that you are a member of a community.','a pillar of the community (= a well respected and active member of a community ) The doctor was regarded as a pillar of the local community.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The new arts centre will serve the whole community.","translation":"مرکز هنری جدید به کل جامعه خدمت خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096858.mp3"},{"sentence":"community education programmes","translation":"برنامه های آموزشی جامعه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691194.mp3"},{"sentence":"We meet once a month to discuss community problems.","translation":"ما ماهی یک بار برای بحث در مورد مشکلات جامعه گرد هم می آییم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096861.mp3"},{"sentence":"Community leaders met to discuss the proposed golf course.","translation":"رهبران جامعه برای بحث در مورد زمین گلف پیشنهادی ملاقات کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691199.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('bbf4330e-112e-5dba-9f46-a86dd61e9858','36f741e4-9f10-5b7d-8ba3-e5ecd88f3e8f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people who have the same interests, religion , race etc','[ countable ]',null,'گروهی از افراد که دارای علایق، مذهب، نژاد و غیره یکسان هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"different ethnic communities","translation":"جوامع قومی مختلف","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096875.mp3"},{"sentence":"the gay community in San Francisco","translation":"جامعه همجنس گرایان در سانفرانسیسکو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691207.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('72f3fbe5-97ab-56de-9034-c38a1d595496','36f741e4-9f10-5b7d-8ba3-e5ecd88f3e8f',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the community','اجتماع، جامعه؛ جمعیت محلی؛ شورای محل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('21cd43c9-2988-5913-86f7-0bdff3d08818','36f741e4-9f10-5b7d-8ba3-e5ecd88f3e8f',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'sense of community','اجتماع، جامعه؛ جمعیت محلی؛ شورای محل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c8561250-bc17-5b0f-9176-fbe85c158234','36f741e4-9f10-5b7d-8ba3-e5ecd88f3e8f',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of plants or animals that live in the same environment','[ countable ]',null,'گروهی از گیاهان یا حیوانات که در یک محیط زندگی می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Communities of otters are slowly returning to British rivers.","translation":"جوامع سمور به آرامی به رودخانه های بریتانیا باز می گردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096895.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('add60087-d8ac-57a8-b484-a94ca85ec256','c5e7677c-2dcf-5e8e-88fe-b5858c0aeea0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement in which someone complains about something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'شکایت، گلایه؛ بیم (پزشکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a complaint (= complain formally to someone ) The manager of the team decided to make a complaint about the referee.','file/lodge a complaint formal (= make a complaint ) She filed a complaint against several of her colleagues.','have a complaint (= want to complain about something ) Please let us know if you have any complaints about our service.','bring a complaint against somebody formal (= complain in a formal, legal way ) Higgins brought a complaint against his former manager.','receive a complaint ( also have a complaint ) Our department has received a number of complaints from the public.','deal with/handle a complaint Police officers came to the house to deal with a complaint about noise.','investigate a complaint The dog was rescued after officials investigated a complaint of neglect.','uphold a complaint (= say it is reasonable ) The complaint was upheld and the advertisement was withdrawn.','a complaint concerns something/relates to something We have received a number of complaints concerning faulty goods.','a formal/official complaint The man has lodged a formal complaint against the police.','a common/widespread/frequent complaint A common complaint of children is that parents do not listen to them.','a serious complaint Serious complaints of negligence have been made.','a customer/consumer complaint As a result of the improvements, customer complaints went down by 70%.','a bitter complaint (= a very angry one ) The people are full of bitter complaints about their government.','a familiar complaint (= one that you have heard many times ) A lack of good public transport is a familiar complaint.','cause/grounds for complaint (= a good reason to complain ) I do not think that he has any cause for complaint.','a letter of complaint I wrote a letter of complaint to the hospital manager.','a complaints procedure (= a system for dealing with complaints ) There is a very straightforward complaints procedure you must follow.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"If you wish to make a complaint, you should see the manager.","translation":"اگر می خواهید شکایت کنید، باید به مدیر مراجعه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875346.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sales assistants are trained to deal with customer complaints in a friendly manner.","translation":"دستیاران فروش برای رسیدگی دوستانه به شکایات مشتریان آموزش دیده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875333.mp3"},{"sentence":"Keating was dismissed after complaints about the quality of his work.","translation":"کیتینگ پس از شکایت در مورد کیفیت کارش از کار برکنار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875336.mp3"},{"sentence":"complaints of police brutality","translation":"شکایت از خشونت پلیس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691158.mp3"},{"sentence":"complaints from local residents","translation":"شکایات ساکنان محلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691161.mp3"},{"sentence":"a complaint to the Advertising Standards Authority","translation":"شکایت به سازمان استانداردهای تبلیغاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691162.mp3"},{"sentence":"All complaints against police officers are carefully investigated.","translation":"تمام شکایات علیه افسران پلیس به دقت بررسی می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875339.mp3"},{"sentence":"We are concerned by complaints that children are being bullied.","translation":"ما نگران شکایت هایی هستیم که کودکان مورد آزار و اذیت قرار می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875342.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('bcf0034e-65a5-5706-8f34-a47e626b4f45','c5e7677c-2dcf-5e8e-88fe-b5858c0aeea0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you complain about','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که شما از آن شکایت دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a complaint (= complain formally to someone ) The manager of the team decided to make a complaint about the referee.','file/lodge a complaint formal (= make a complaint ) She filed a complaint against several of her colleagues.','have a complaint (= want to complain about something ) Please let us know if you have any complaints about our service.','bring a complaint against somebody formal (= complain in a formal, legal way ) Higgins brought a complaint against his former manager.','receive a complaint ( also have a complaint ) Our department has received a number of complaints from the public.','deal with/handle a complaint Police officers came to the house to deal with a complaint about noise.','investigate a complaint The dog was rescued after officials investigated a complaint of neglect.','uphold a complaint (= say it is reasonable ) The complaint was upheld and the advertisement was withdrawn.','a complaint concerns something/relates to something We have received a number of complaints concerning faulty goods.','a formal/official complaint The man has lodged a formal complaint against the police.','a common/widespread/frequent complaint A common complaint of children is that parents do not listen to them.','a serious complaint Serious complaints of negligence have been made.','a customer/consumer complaint As a result of the improvements, customer complaints went down by 70%.','a bitter complaint (= a very angry one ) The people are full of bitter complaints about their government.','a familiar complaint (= one that you have heard many times ) A lack of good public transport is a familiar complaint.','cause/grounds for complaint (= a good reason to complain ) I do not think that he has any cause for complaint.','a letter of complaint I wrote a letter of complaint to the hospital manager.','a complaints procedure (= a system for dealing with complaints ) There is a very straightforward complaints procedure you must follow.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our main complaint was the poor standard of service.","translation":"شکایت اصلی ما استاندارد ضعیف خدمات بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875367.mp3"},{"sentence":"My only complaint is that the price is rather high.","translation":"تنها شکایت من این است که قیمت نسبتاً بالا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691176.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bbc7c21d-4e20-5889-9ef2-7e680a723554','c5e7677c-2dcf-5e8e-88fe-b5858c0aeea0',3,null,null,'formal','an illness that affects a particular part of your body','[ countable ]',null,'بیماری که قسمت خاصی از بدن شما را تحت تاثیر قرار می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a complaint (= complain formally to someone ) The manager of the team decided to make a complaint about the referee.','file/lodge a complaint formal (= make a complaint ) She filed a complaint against several of her colleagues.','have a complaint (= want to complain about something ) Please let us know if you have any complaints about our service.','bring a complaint against somebody formal (= complain in a formal, legal way ) Higgins brought a complaint against his former manager.','receive a complaint ( also have a complaint ) Our department has received a number of complaints from the public.','deal with/handle a complaint Police officers came to the house to deal with a complaint about noise.','investigate a complaint The dog was rescued after officials investigated a complaint of neglect.','uphold a complaint (= say it is reasonable ) The complaint was upheld and the advertisement was withdrawn.','a complaint concerns something/relates to something We have received a number of complaints concerning faulty goods.','a formal/official complaint The man has lodged a formal complaint against the police.','a common/widespread/frequent complaint A common complaint of children is that parents do not listen to them.','a serious complaint Serious complaints of negligence have been made.','a customer/consumer complaint As a result of the improvements, customer complaints went down by 70%.','a bitter complaint (= a very angry one ) The people are full of bitter complaints about their government.','a familiar complaint (= one that you have heard many times ) A lack of good public transport is a familiar complaint.','cause/grounds for complaint (= a good reason to complain ) I do not think that he has any cause for complaint.','a letter of complaint I wrote a letter of complaint to the hospital manager.','a complaints procedure (= a system for dealing with complaints ) There is a very straightforward complaints procedure you must follow.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is having treatment for a chest complaint .","translation":"او برای شکایت قفسه سینه تحت درمان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875372.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('944e01de-6d20-5e48-a4cc-e8366d8ebbcd','981a9a23-58e5-5717-93d6-147ea87f20c9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','one of several parts that together make up a whole machine , system etc',null,null,'قطعه، جزء (ماشین/سامانه)؛ بخش',array['constituent']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"companies that make electronic components for computer products","translation":"شرکت هایی که قطعات الکترونیکی برای محصولات کامپیوتری تولید می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876506.mp3"},{"sentence":"each component of their work","translation":"هر یک از اجزای کار آنها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697096.mp3"},{"sentence":"Exercise is one of the key components of a healthy lifestyle.","translation":"ورزش یکی از اجزای کلیدی یک سبک زندگی سالم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697099.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('d0041b7d-dd33-5045-a306-4f5b3be85abb','9138db26-17c8-5902-9db5-4e80591de1ad',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the component parts of something are the parts that it consists of',null,null,'اجزای تشکیل دهنده یک چیز اجزایی هستند که از آن تشکیل شده است',array['constituent']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ve been breaking down the budget into its component parts.","translation":"ما بودجه را به اجزای سازنده آن تقسیم کرده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697308.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c1d3e0a0-335f-538e-a3ee-9df2c508cc5a','13f00cee-d135-57ec-9910-ac3b43b8f01f',1,'involved','درگیر','spoken & written','involved in something or affected by it','[ not before noun ]',null,'دلبسته، ذی‌نفع؛ نگران؛ مربوط','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Divorce is very painful, especially when children are concerned.","translation":"طلاق بسیار دردناک است، مخصوصاً وقتی بچه ها نگران هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100316.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the farmers concerned suffer particularly from the low prices.","translation":"برخی از کشاورزان مربوطه به ویژه از قیمت پایین رنج می برند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687979.mp3"},{"sentence":"We are trying to reach an agreement with all concerned (= everyone who is involved or affected ) .","translation":"ما در تلاش هستیم تا با همه افراد ذینفع (= هر کسی که درگیر یا متاثر است) به توافق برسیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687980.mp3"},{"sentence":"all the people concerned with children’s education","translation":"همه افرادی که درگیر آموزش کودکان هستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100322.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was no evidence that he was concerned in any criminal activity.","translation":"هیچ مدرکی مبنی بر نگرانی او در هر گونه فعالیت مجرمانه وجود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100319.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('1d4e04ea-44e6-5543-95fd-7161079eda1b','13f00cee-d135-57ec-9910-ac3b43b8f01f',2,'worried','نگران','spoken & written','worried about something',null,null,'نگران چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She is concerned about how little food I eat.","translation":"او نگران این است که من چقدر غذای کمی می‌خورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100331.mp3"},{"sentence":"He called the police because he was concerned for Gemma’s safety.","translation":"او با پلیس تماس گرفت زیرا نگران امنیت جما بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100334.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pamela was concerned that her schoolwork had deteriorated despite her hard work.","translation":"پاملا نگران بود که علیرغم سخت کوشی، کار مدرسه اش بدتر شده باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100337.mp3"},{"sentence":"The drug came under strong attack from concerned professional observers.","translation":"این دارو مورد حمله شدید ناظران حرفه ای نگران قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100328.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
