('c4a40e97-c5e1-50ca-b46d-11d69315f781','59cc248b-3773-50d4-8366-2917f380214e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','willing to do anything to change a very bad situation, and not caring about danger',null,null,'سراسیمه، نومید؛ حیاتی و فوری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had no money left and was desperate.","translation":"پولی نداشتم و مستأصل بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819933.mp3"},{"sentence":"Time was running out and we were getting desperate .","translation":"زمان رو به اتمام بود و ما ناامید می شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716139.mp3"},{"sentence":"the missing teenager’s desperate parents","translation":"والدین ناامید نوجوان گمشده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819934.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was desperate with fear.","translation":"او از ترس ناامید شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716142.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('70469195-c95c-5832-9ee9-65a951247abe','59cc248b-3773-50d4-8366-2917f380214e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','needing or wanting something very much',null,null,'نیاز یا خواستن بسیار به چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The team is desperate for a win.","translation":"این تیم به دنبال پیروزی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716143.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was desperate for a cigarette.","translation":"دلم برای سیگار تنگ شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819942.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was desperate to get a job.","translation":"او برای یافتن شغل ناامید بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819945.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bb2a53fb-8745-56f7-a077-cc17a95ec8ca','59cc248b-3773-50d4-8366-2917f380214e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a desperate situation is very bad or serious',null,null,'یک وضعیت ناامید کننده بسیار بد یا جدی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a desperate shortage of doctors","translation":"کمبود شدید پزشک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819952.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re in desperate need of help.","translation":"ما شدیداً به کمک نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819948.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('360893a8-e932-5e9c-bdeb-846950726d51','59cc248b-3773-50d4-8366-2917f380214e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a desperate action is something that you only do because you are in a very bad situation',null,null,'اقدام ناامیدانه کاری است که شما فقط به این دلیل انجام می دهید که در وضعیت بسیار بدی قرار دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a desperate attempt Brian’s parents agreed to the treatment in a desperate attempt to save his life.','a desperate bid (= attempt ) He was standing in the middle of the road in a desperate bid to get help.','a desperate effort A desperate effort was made to reach an agreement.','a desperate struggle/battle/fight The climbers faced a desperate struggle to reach safety.','desperate measures (= extreme things you do to stop a problem or bad situation ) They had to take desperate measures to stop the spread of the disease.','a desperate search The female bear has left her young in a desperate search for food.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a desperate attempt to escape","translation":"تلاش ناامیدانه برای فرار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000819958.mp3"},{"sentence":"We resorted to desperate measures .","translation":"ما به اقدامات ناامیدانه متوسل شدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716149.mp3"},{"sentence":"a desperate struggle to rescue the men","translation":"مبارزه ناامیدانه برای نجات مردان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716155.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0663af09-ffa3-55a9-b678-54d7a7e7cca4','9663fc17-ca65-5633-9cb0-375545ab2cf7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to find out the facts about something',null,null,'تعیین کردن؛ تعیین (سرنوشت)؛ استوار کردن',array['establish']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Investigators are still trying to determine the cause of the fire.","translation":"تحقیقات همچنان در حال بررسی علت آتش سوزی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716590.mp3"},{"sentence":"The aim of the inquiry was to determine what had caused the accident.","translation":"هدف از تحقیقات مشخص شدن علت حادثه بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716591.mp3"},{"sentence":"Experts have determined that the signature was forged.","translation":"کارشناسان تشخیص داده اند که این امضا جعلی بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716594.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ca25cdc4-637e-56a2-8e80-6259f00c73dd','9663fc17-ca65-5633-9cb0-375545ab2cf7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if something determines something else, it directly influences or decides it',null,null,'اگر چیزی چیز دیگری را تعیین می کند، مستقیماً بر آن تأثیر می گذارد یا تصمیم می گیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The amount of available water determines the number of houses that can be built.","translation":"مقدار آب موجود تعداد خانه هایی را که می توان ساخت تعیین می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001138594.mp3"},{"sentence":"The age of a wine is a determining factor as to how it tastes.","translation":"سن یک شراب عامل تعیین کننده ای برای طعم آن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716595.mp3"},{"sentence":"How hard the swimmers work now will determine how they perform in the Olympics.","translation":"اینکه شناگران اکنون چقدر سخت کار می کنند، عملکرد آنها در المپیک را مشخص می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716601.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('1887216f-53de-5ff3-8232-ef6b5a4b2c0d','9663fc17-ca65-5633-9cb0-375545ab2cf7',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially decide something',null,null,'برای تصمیم گیری رسمی برای چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The date of the court case has not yet been determined.","translation":"تاریخ دادگاه هنوز مشخص نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001138598.mp3"},{"sentence":"The tests will help the doctors determine what treatment to use.","translation":"این آزمایش ها به پزشکان کمک می کند تا از چه درمانی استفاده کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716604.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0db6828b-e470-5dc7-80fe-02bdda929270','9663fc17-ca65-5633-9cb0-375545ab2cf7',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'determine to do something','تعیین کردن؛ تعیین (سرنوشت)؛ استوار کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3390af14-12c5-56d2-ae73-d828ed1f203e','2cc76603-4788-53fd-87ed-b3271798787a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not like something or someone else, or not like before',null,null,'متفاوت، دیگر؛ گوناگون؛ مشکوک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Our sons are very different from each other.","translation":"پسرهای ما خیلی با هم فرق دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143586.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her jacket’s different to mine.","translation":"ژاکت او با من فرق دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143589.mp3"},{"sentence":"He seemed different than he did in New York.","translation":"او متفاوت از نیویورک به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143592.mp3"},{"sentence":"The place looks completely different now.","translation":"اکنون مکان کاملاً متفاوت به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007547.mp3"},{"sentence":"They decided to try a radically different approach.","translation":"آنها تصمیم گرفتند رویکرد کاملا متفاوتی را امتحان کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007551.mp3"},{"sentence":"We found women had significantly different political views from men.","translation":"ما دریافتیم که زنان دیدگاه‌های سیاسی متفاوتی با مردان داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007555.mp3"},{"sentence":"a slightly different way of doing things","translation":"یک روش کمی متفاوت برای انجام کارها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007559.mp3"},{"sentence":"What actually happened was subtly different from the PR people’s version.","translation":"آنچه در واقع اتفاق افتاد به طور ماهرانه ای با نسخه افراد روابط عمومی متفاوت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007563.mp3"},{"sentence":"The show is refreshingly different from most exhibitions of modern art.","translation":"این نمایش به طرز طراعی با بیشتر نمایشگاه های هنر مدرن متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007567.mp3"},{"sentence":"The publishing business is no different from any other business in this respect.","translation":"کسب و کار انتشارات از این نظر با سایر مشاغل تفاوتی ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007571.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a different world here in London.","translation":"اینجا در لندن دنیای متفاوتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007575.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their home is different from ours.","translation":"خانه آنها با ما فرق دارد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Their home is different than ours.","translation":"خانه آنها با ما فرق دارد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Their home is different to ours.","translation":"خانه آنها با ما فرق دارد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,14),
('b603517b-d05c-588f-b1fe-845113f24929','2cc76603-4788-53fd-87ed-b3271798787a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to talk about two or more separate things of the same basic kind','[ only before noun ]',null,'برای صحبت در مورد دو یا چند چیز جداگانه از یک نوع اصلی استفاده می شود',array['various']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Different people reacted in different ways .","translation":"افراد مختلف به روش های مختلف واکنش نشان دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690036.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are many different types of fabric.","translation":"انواع مختلفی از پارچه وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143601.mp3"},{"sentence":"I looked in lots of different books but couldn’t find anything about it.","translation":"من در بسیاری از کتاب های مختلف جستجو کردم اما چیزی در مورد آن پیدا نکردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690042.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a03a7737-ec81-5ce3-8465-fb876cd05cb3','2cc76603-4788-53fd-87ed-b3271798787a',3,null,null,'spoken & written','another','[ only before noun ]',null,'دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I think she’s moved to a different job now.","translation":"من فکر می کنم که او اکنون به یک کار دیگر نقل مکان کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143606.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f4124585-8428-50a3-8033-1d968ca3f676','2cc76603-4788-53fd-87ed-b3271798787a',4,null,null,'spoken','unusual , often in a way that you do not like',null,null,'غیر معمول، اغلب به روشی که شما دوست ندارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘What did you think of the film?’ ‘Well, it was certainly different.’","translation":"«نظرت در مورد فیلم چی بود؟» «خب، مطمئناً متفاوت بود.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001143620.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a7668510-1fab-5bc9-bf17-bcc86ce93975','ee0332bb-0802-5917-b5e1-9c4a7fc457f7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','hard to do, understand , or deal with',null,null,'دشوار، سخت؛ عصبی، بدخلق','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a difficult question","translation":"یک سوال دشوار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823612.mp3"},{"sentence":"an immensely difficult task","translation":"یک کار فوق العاده دشوار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689797.mp3"},{"sentence":"Was the exam very difficult?","translation":"امتحان خیلی سخت بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823611.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s difficult to see how more savings can be made.","translation":"دیدن اینکه چگونه می توان بیشتر پس انداز کرد دشوار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689798.mp3"},{"sentence":"That’s rather difficult for me to explain.","translation":"توضیح آن برای من نسبتاً دشوار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830846.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s finding it difficult to get a job.","translation":"او برای یافتن شغل مشکل دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823615.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a4cf7e5d-9cfe-544b-9224-b2015829a49d','ee0332bb-0802-5917-b5e1-9c4a7fc457f7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','involving a lot of problems and causing a lot of trouble or worry',null,null,'مشکلات زیادی را شامل می شود و باعث دردسر یا نگرانی زیادی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a difficult situation","translation":"یک وضعیت دشوار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689807.mp3"},{"sentence":"Things are a bit difficult at home at the moment.","translation":"در حال حاضر شرایط در خانه کمی سخت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823623.mp3"},{"sentence":"There could be difficult times ahead.","translation":"ممکن است زمان های سختی در پیش باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689808.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s doing everything she can to make life difficult for him.","translation":"او تمام تلاش خود را می کند تا زندگی را برای او سخت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823627.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('37f77a94-9e2f-5481-b338-c29f62369c95','ee0332bb-0802-5917-b5e1-9c4a7fc457f7',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is difficult never seems pleased or satisfied',null,null,'کسی که سخت است هرگز خشنود یا راضی به نظر نمی رسد',array['awkward']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Don’t be so difficult!","translation":"اینقدر سخت نباش!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823619.mp3"},{"sentence":"a difficult customer","translation":"یک مشتری دشوار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689810.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0f020107-803c-58a8-8370-ec58022208ee','d541d77a-4a5a-5f02-bbea-32707ceacdf3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of a situation or a quality involved in it',null,null,'بُعد؛ وجه، جنبه؛ اندازه (پهنا/بلندی)',array['aspect']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['add/give/bring a new etc dimension to something Digital cameras have added a new dimension to photography.','have a new/social etc dimension Learning a language has an important cultural dimension.','take on a new/extra etc dimension (= develop in a way that is new or different ) Since I met her, my life has taken on a completely different dimension.','a new/different dimension The size of the bombs gave a new dimension to the terrorists’ campaign.','an extra/added/additional/further dimension Movies soon had the added dimension of sound.','a social/political/cultural dimension His writing has a strong political dimension.','a moral/ethical dimension The book discusses the ethical dimension involved in genetic engineering.','a spiritual dimension He was interested in the spiritual dimension to art.','the human dimension What the figures cannot show us is the human dimension of the disaster.','an international dimension The foreign players bring an international dimension to the English Premier League.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the moral dimension of world politics","translation":"بعد اخلاقی سیاست جهانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689929.mp3"},{"sentence":"His coaching has added another dimension to my game.","translation":"مربیگری او بعد دیگری به بازی من اضافه کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000824265.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important to keep in mind the historical dimension to these issues.","translation":"در نظر گرفتن ابعاد تاریخی این موضوعات مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000824268.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can have a spiritual dimension to your life without being religious.","translation":"شما می توانید بدون مذهبی بودن جنبه معنوی در زندگی خود داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830623.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
