('14a4357c-3539-587d-9716-05b6cacd8ddd','256fdc53-6e16-5831-bfdb-1cdb532250ce',1,'towards','به سمت','spoken & written','the way something or someone moves, faces, or is aimed','[ countable ]',null,'جهت، سمت؛ رهنمود؛ راهنمای (نصب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go in a direction I can give you a lift if you''re going in my direction.','move/head in a direction We followed the other passengers heading in the direction of passport control.','look/glance in a direction She looked in the direction that Jeremy was pointing.','face (in) a direction The men were facing the direction from which they expected the attack.','change direction (= start to go in a different direction ) Suddenly the birds changed direction.','the right/wrong direction Are you sure this is the right direction for Shipton?','the opposite direction The car crashed into a truck that was coming in the opposite direction.','a southerly/westerly etc direction A strong wind was blowing from an easterly direction.','in each/every direction ( also in all directions ) At the top of the tower there are splendid views in every direction.','in both directions The traffic in both directions on the motorway wasn''t moving at all.','in different directions They said goodbye and walked off in different directions.','in the general direction of something (= approximately where something is ) He pointed in the general direction of the village.','in a clockwise/anticlockwise direction (= like or unlike the movement of the hands of a clock ) All movement on a roundabout is in a clockwise direction.','a sense of direction (= the ability to judge which way you should be going ) Do you have a good sense of direction?','the direction of movement/travel/flow etc It was hard work rowing against the direction of flow.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Which direction did they go in ?","translation":"به کدام سمت رفتند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694927.mp3"},{"sentence":"The suspects were last seen heading in the direction of Miami.","translation":"مظنونان آخرین بار در حال حرکت به سمت میامی دیده شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694928.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tony glanced in her direction and their eyes met.","translation":"تونی نگاهی به سمت او انداخت و چشمان آنها به هم رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694932.mp3"},{"sentence":"The girls pointed in the opposite direction .","translation":"دخترها به سمت مخالف اشاره کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694938.mp3"},{"sentence":"On seeing me, Maurice changed direction and went along the wharf instead.","translation":"موریس با دیدن من تغییر جهت داد و به جای آن از اسکله رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694942.mp3"},{"sentence":"As shots rang out, the crowd ran screaming in all directions .","translation":"با بلند شدن تیراندازی، جمعیت با فریاد به هر طرف دویدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694946.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was a loud scream from the direction of the children’s pool.","translation":"صدای جیغ بلندی از سمت استخر بچه ها بلند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694950.mp3"},{"sentence":"Continue in a southerly direction until you reach the road.","translation":"در جهت جنوب ادامه دهید تا به جاده برسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001145567.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
