training.','nursery/pre-school education (= for children aged under 5 ) The funding will provide nursery education for all four-year-olds.','have an education The women have had little education.','get/receive an education Some children grow up without receiving any education.','give/provide an education The school aims to provide a good general education.','enter education (= start going to school, college etc ) The number of students entering higher education has risen.','leave education British English (= stop going to school, college etc ) She left full-time education at the age of 16.','continue your education I hope to continue my education after high school.','the education system (= the way education is organized and managed in a country ) Is the British education system failing some children?','the education department (= the government organization that makes decisions about education ) Newcastle City Council’s education department','an education authority (= a government organization that makes official decisions about education in one particular area ) The school is funded by the local education authority.','the education service (= all the government organizations that work together to provide education ) There are plans to expand the adult education service.','education policy (= political plans for managing an education system ) The teaching unions are calling for the government to review its education policy.','education reform (= changes that a government makes to the education system in a country ) the government’s programme of education reform']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Having Jimmy to stay has been quite an education!","translation":"ماندن جیمی کاملاً یک آموزش بوده است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637644.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('10ad6a12-3009-56e7-9945-c2af8f4a1c1a','2af9a9fb-a0af-5ec4-8901-7046986d7a94',1,null,null,'spoken & written','successful , and working in the way that was intended',null,null,'مؤثر، کارا؛ چهره واقعی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['extremely/highly effective The company launched a highly effective advertising campaign.','an effective way What’s the most effective way to control crime?','an effective method Exams are not the most effective method of assessing students’ abilities.','an effective means Is reducing the speed limit an effective means of reducing accidents?','effective action The police must take effective action to protect the public.','an effective solution The most effective solution to traffic congestion is to build more roads.','an effective treatment Antibiotics are still the most effective treatment for this disease.','an effective system The country has a simple but effective welfare system.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The cheaper drugs are just as effective in treating arthritis.","translation":"داروهای ارزانتر به همان اندازه در درمان آرتریت موثر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001182090.mp3"},{"sentence":"the painting’s highly effective use of colour","translation":"استفاده بسیار موثر نقاشی از رنگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637795.mp3"},{"sentence":"Training is often much less effective than expected.","translation":"آموزش اغلب بسیار کمتر از آنچه انتظار می رود مؤثر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637799.mp3"},{"sentence":"the most effective ways of reducing inner city congestion","translation":"موثرترین راه های کاهش ازدحام درون شهری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637803.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cheaper drugs work just as well .","translation":"داروهای ارزانتر نیز به همین خوبی کار می کنند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('cb6b6e6f-48a3-549d-aa16-26c19f604160','2af9a9fb-a0af-5ec4-8901-7046986d7a94',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a law , agreement , or system becomes effective, it officially starts','[ no comparative, not before noun ]',null,'اگر قانون، توافقنامه یا سیستمی لازم الاجرا شود، به طور رسمی شروع می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['extremely/highly effective The company launched a highly effective advertising campaign.','an effective way What’s the most effective way to control crime?','an effective method Exams are not the most effective method of assessing students’ abilities.','an effective means Is reducing the speed limit an effective means of reducing accidents?','effective action The police must take effective action to protect the public.','an effective solution The most effective solution to traffic congestion is to build more roads.','an effective treatment Antibiotics are still the most effective treatment for this disease.','an effective system The country has a simple but effective welfare system.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The cut in interest rates is effective from Monday.","translation":"کاهش نرخ بهره از روز دوشنبه اعمال می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001182100.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('656d4b23-189b-5809-8df2-0084f3dc4520','2af9a9fb-a0af-5ec4-8901-7046986d7a94',3,null,null,'spoken & written','real rather than what is officially intended or generally believed','[ no comparative, only before noun ]',null,'واقعی به جای آن چیزی که رسماً در نظر گرفته شده یا به طور کلی باور می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['extremely/highly effective The company launched a highly effective advertising campaign.','an effective way What’s the most effective way to control crime?','an effective method Exams are not the most effective method of assessing students’ abilities.','an effective means Is reducing the speed limit an effective means of reducing accidents?','effective action The police must take effective action to protect the public.','an effective solution The most effective solution to traffic congestion is to build more roads.','an effective treatment Antibiotics are still the most effective treatment for this disease.','an effective system The country has a simple but effective welfare system.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The rebels are in effective control of the city.","translation":"شورشیان کنترل موثری بر شهر دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001182105.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('10458f1e-2318-5bbc-9697-736d633a8c57','87f1e504-9a80-52ae-b8c1-c6b63b6b8bda',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if someone or something is efficient, they work well without wasting time, money, or energy',null,null,'کارا، مؤثر (بدون اتلاف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['extremely/highly efficient The factory is modern and highly efficient.','an efficient way Email is an efficient way of contacting a large number of people.','an efficient method The railways used to provide a cheap efficient method of travel.','an efficient means The tram is a very efficient means of transport.','an efficient system We need a more efficient system for collecting money.','an efficient service We aim to provide our clients with an efficient and friendly service.','the efficient use of something We must work towards the more efficient use of all natural resources.','the efficient operation of something The law must protect investors without interfering with the efficient operation of the market.','energy/fuel efficient (= not wasting any fuel or energy ) an energy efficient heating system','cost efficient (= costing or spending as little as possible ) The larger a firm becomes the more cost efficient it can become.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a very efficient secretary","translation":"منشی بسیار کارآمد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001182291.mp3"},{"sentence":"an efficient use of land","translation":"استفاده کارآمد از زمین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001182290.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lighting is now more energy efficient .","translation":"در حال حاضر روشنایی انرژی کارآمدتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637513.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a614d6fc-d4b1-58f7-8c9f-bb19770cfd72','4c69460e-1cdb-54f5-9842-baf93a20ec98',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in, at, or to another place',null,null,'در جای دیگر، جای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She is becoming famous in Australia and elsewhere.","translation":"او در استرالیا و جاهای دیگر مشهور می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001185118.mp3"},{"sentence":"Kerala has less crime and alcoholism than elsewhere in India.","translation":"کرالا نسبت به سایر نقاط هند جرم و جنایت و اعتیاد به الکل کمتری دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629737.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f3ac01d1-25f9-5855-bd6b-c600a45f433c','de8afc69-27dc-53c9-800b-e6579baa098c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an unexpected and dangerous situation that must be dealt with immediately',null,'state of emergency','اضطرار، وضعیت اضطراری؛ فوری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['deal with an emergency Several fire crews were called to deal with the emergency at the power plant.','cope with an emergency (= succeed in dealing with an emergency ) Do you think that you could cope with an emergency?','handle an emergency (= deal with and make decisions about an emergency ) There is always a doctor on call to handle emergencies.','an emergency situation If an emergency situation arises, the pilot and crew must stay calm.','emergency aid/relief/help (= things such as food and medicine that are given to people when they are in a very dangerous situation ) The charity made a television appeal for emergency aid to the region.','emergency treatment (= medical treatment given to someone when they have been injured or become ill suddenly ) The driver is undergoing emergency treatment at Park Royal Hospital.','an emergency operation (= a medical operation that is carried out quickly when someone has been injured or become ill suddenly ) He had an emergency operation to save his sight.','an emergency meeting (= a meeting that is arranged quickly to discuss a very serious situation ) The cabinet held an emergency meeting earlier today.','an emergency session (= a political meeting that is arranged quickly to discuss a very serious situation ) an emergency session of the UN Security Council','emergency measures (= special actions that are taken to deal with a very serious situation ) The president announced emergency measures to deal with terrorism.','emergency powers (= special powers that are given to the government, police, or army because there is a very serious situation ) The army was given emergency powers to help tackle the rising violence.','an emergency vehicle (= an ambulance or fire engine ) Emergency vehicles rushed to the scene.','a serious emergency (= a situation which involves danger to people ) The police usually respond quickly to serious emergencies.','an extreme emergency (= a situation that is very worrying or dangerous ) These weapons should be used only in an extreme emergency.','a major emergency (= a dangerous situation that affects a large number of people ) In a major emergency, the national guard may be called in.','a sudden/unexpected/unforeseen emergency (= a situation that was not planned ) I left half an hour early in case of traffic jams or some other unforeseen emergency.','in case of emergency/in the event of an emergency (= if there is an emergency ) The fire-exit doors should only be opened in case of emergency.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lifeguards are trained to deal with emergencies .","translation":"نجات غریق برای مقابله با شرایط اضطراری آموزش دیده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186343.mp3"},{"sentence":"The staff need to know what to do in an emergency.","translation":"کارکنان باید بدانند در مواقع اضطراری چه کاری انجام دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646148.mp3"},{"sentence":"In case of emergency , press the alarm button.","translation":"در مواقع اضطراری، دکمه هشدار را فشار دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646149.mp3"},{"sentence":"$500,000 of emergency aid for the victims of the earthquake","translation":"500 هزار دلار کمک اضطراری به زلزله زدگان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646152.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plane had to make an emergency landing .","translation":"هواپیما مجبور به فرود اضطراری شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646159.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government called an emergency meeting to discuss the crisis.","translation":"دولت برای بررسی این بحران یک جلسه اضطراری تشکیل داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646160.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('ddba872a-317e-59fa-b823-d6f5e3e4ec37','75dbbb0b-a366-530b-b7bb-031c49515651',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to your feelings or how you control them','[ only before noun ]',null,'عاطفی، احساسی؛ پرشور (پاسخ)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She provided emotional support at a very distressing time for me.","translation":"او در یک زمان بسیار ناراحت کننده برای من حمایت عاطفی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646212.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ann suffered from depression and a number of other emotional problems .","translation":"آن از افسردگی و تعدادی از مشکلات عاطفی دیگر رنج می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646216.mp3"},{"sentence":"the physical and emotional state of the patient","translation":"وضعیت جسمی و روحی بیمار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186696.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('721a1593-5393-597b-af61-7c4060640860','75dbbb0b-a366-530b-b7bb-031c49515651',2,null,null,'spoken & written','making people have strong feelings',null,null,'ایجاد احساسات قوی در افراد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Abortion is a very emotional issue .","translation":"سقط جنین یک مسئله بسیار احساسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186688.mp3"},{"sentence":"The funeral was a very emotional experience for all of us.","translation":"تشییع جنازه برای همه ما یک تجربه بسیار احساسی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646226.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7d4a3fd1-3852-5838-82fb-b78f1378f434','75dbbb0b-a366-530b-b7bb-031c49515651',3,null,null,'spoken & written','having strong feelings and showing them to other people, especially by crying',null,null,'داشتن احساسات قوی و نشان دادن آنها به دیگران، به ویژه با گریه کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He became very emotional when we had to leave.","translation":"وقتی مجبور شدیم بریم خیلی احساساتی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186691.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c71e7733-1de4-5e3c-9280-4df1c63f01f0','75dbbb0b-a366-530b-b7bb-031c49515651',4,null,null,'spoken & written','influenced by what you feel, rather than what you know',null,null,'تحت تأثیر آنچه احساس می کنید، نه آنچه می دانید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an emotional response to the problem","translation":"یک پاسخ احساسی به مشکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186700.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3f21594f-5534-536a-b4bc-b0723762f0e9','f730d480-6b87-55b8-8891-6030404692f6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to say something in a strong way',null,null,'تأکید کردن، برجسته کردن (سخن)',array['stress']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The report emphasizes the importance of improving safety standards.","translation":"در این گزارش بر اهمیت بهبود استانداردهای ایمنی تاکید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646261.mp3"},{"sentence":"Logan made a speech emphasizing the need for more volunteers.","translation":"لوگان در سخنرانی خود بر نیاز به تعداد داوطلبان بیشتر تاکید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001186836.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prime minister emphasized that there are no plans to raise taxes.","translation":"نخست وزیر تاکید کرد که برنامه ای برای افزایش مالیات وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646274.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('d30a7d23-5410-5ee7-ac7b-be0232fcf5cf','f730d480-6b87-55b8-8891-6030404692f6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to say a word or phrase louder or higher than others to give it more importance',null,null,'گفتن یک کلمه یا عبارت بلندتر یا بالاتر از دیگران برای اهمیت دادن به آن',array['stress']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a7868efa-2685-596a-9241-73d4787c6526','f730d480-6b87-55b8-8891-6030404692f6',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to make something more noticeable',null,null,'تا چیزی قابل توجه تر شود',array['accentuate']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The dress emphasized the shape of her body.","translation":"این لباس بر فرم بدن او تأکید داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001646281.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3f63e5dd-4864-5f1e-ac26-bfaa6a3544bb','2ca9e9f2-9ee7-5c1b-9b4a-52aeaeae2f4d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to experience something, especially problems or opposition',null,null,'مواجه شدن (با مشکل، مقاومت)؛ برخورد کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They encountered serious problems when two members of the expedition were injured.","translation":"آنها با مجروح شدن دو نفر از اعضای اعزامی با مشکلات جدی مواجه شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645745.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government has encountered strong opposition to its plans to raise income tax.","translation":"دولت با برنامه های خود برای افزایش مالیات بر درآمد مخالفت شدیدی داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645748.mp3"},{"sentence":"The doctor had encountered several similar cases in the past.","translation":"دکتر در گذشته با چندین مورد مشابه مواجه شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645749.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you come across any problems?","translation":"آیا به مشکلی برخورد کردید؟","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"We came up against quite a lot of opposition from local people.","translation":"ما با مخالفت بسیار زیادی از سوی مردم محلی روبرو شدیم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('5a16a202-668f-52c8-a288-a415f09e7526','2ca9e9f2-9ee7-5c1b-9b4a-52aeaeae2f4d',2,null,null,'formal','to meet someone without planning to',null,null,'ملاقات با کسی بدون برنامه ریزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I first encountered him when studying at Cambridge.","translation":"من اولین بار هنگام تحصیل در کمبریج با او روبرو شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001189653.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('00c64575-aa8d-5f18-b739-fa46d4bf876b','aedb4082-962d-53b9-9d70-8d6f3ca96830',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an occasion when you meet someone, or do something with someone you do not know',null,null,'موقعیتی که با کسی ملاقات می‌کنید یا با کسی که نمی‌شناسید کاری انجام می‌دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She didn’t remember our encounter last summer.","translation":"او برخورد تابستان گذشته ما را به خاطر نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001189889.mp3"},{"sentence":"His first encounter with Wilson was back in 1989.","translation":"اولین برخورد او با ویلسون در سال 1989 بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645753.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bernstein began training the young musician after a chance encounter at a concert (= a meeting that happened by chance ) .","translation":"برنشتاین پس از یک برخورد تصادفی در یک کنسرت (= ملاقاتی که به طور تصادفی اتفاق افتاد) آموزش نوازنده جوان را آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645757.mp3"},{"sentence":"casual sexual encounters (= occasions when people have sex )","translation":"برخوردهای جنسی گاه به گاه (= مواردی که افراد رابطه جنسی دارند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645762.mp3"},{"sentence":"hostile encounters between supporters of rival football teams","translation":"برخوردهای خصمانه هواداران تیم های فوتبال رقیب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645768.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('707672ed-94f0-5563-acb4-912fc1ff39e0','aedb4082-962d-53b9-9d70-8d6f3ca96830',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an occasion when you meet or experience something',null,null,'موقعیت زمانی که شما چیزی را ملاقات یا تجربه می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a child’s first encounter with books","translation":"اولین برخورد کودک با کتاب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645773.mp3"},{"sentence":"a close encounter with a snake (= a frightening situation in which you get too close to something )","translation":"برخورد نزدیک با مار (= موقعیتی ترسناک که در آن خیلی به چیزی نزدیک می شوید)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001189900.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('94c5a59a-45e0-5daa-ad83-62b52aad1668','f11bcaa0-8e98-5426-86fc-46e82c85c070',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give someone the courage or confidence to do something',null,null,'ترغیب کردن، تشویق کردن؛ دل‌گرم کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I want to thank everyone who has encouraged and supported me.","translation":"می خواهم از همه کسانی که مرا تشویق و حمایت کردند تشکر کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001189914.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cooder was encouraged to begin playing the guitar by his father.","translation":"کودر توسط پدرش تشویق به شروع نواختن گیتار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677897.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fleur encouraged Dana in her ambition to become a model.","translation":"فلور دانا را تشویق کرد تا بتواند مدل شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677900.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6bb4356d-0869-5b2b-8049-2f0b18c37e1a','f11bcaa0-8e98-5426-86fc-46e82c85c070',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to persuade someone to do something',null,null,'متقاعد کردن کسی برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Cantor didn’t mind if they worked late; in fact, he actively encouraged it.","translation":"کانتور بدش نمی آمد که دیر کار کنند. در واقع، او فعالانه آن را تشویق کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677905.mp3"},{"sentence":"A 10p rise in cigarette prices is not enough to encourage smokers to stop.","translation":"افزایش 10 درصدی قیمت سیگار برای تشویق افراد سیگاری به ترک سیگار کافی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677911.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('70e55610-4300-5a46-9934-84f4504193d4','f11bcaa0-8e98-5426-86fc-46e82c85c070',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to make something more likely to exist , happen, or develop',null,null,'احتمال وجود، اتفاق افتادن یا توسعه چیزی را بیشتر کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Violent TV programmes encourage anti-social behaviour.","translation":"برنامه های تلویزیونی خشونت آمیز رفتارهای ضد اجتماعی را تشویق می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677912.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e08515f8-4aea-5cdf-99dd-52772db747d5','5772f329-2f47-5504-95b6-98159b937ae5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something enjoyable gives you pleasure',null,null,'لذت‌بخش، خوشایند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Games can make learning more enjoyable.","translation":"بازی ها می توانند یادگیری را لذت بخش تر کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001195709.mp3"},{"sentence":"an enjoyable experience","translation":"یک تجربه لذت بخش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001678686.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('df37991d-7171-5762-9c57-869076b59655','1638eab4-1fd6-598b-b4d9-3564fb94a5bb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the tools , machines etc that you need to do a particular job or activity','[ uncountable ]',null,'تجهیزات، ابزار و وسایل؛ بی‌طرفی (دولتی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a piece of equipment When you buy an expensive piece of equipment, you need to insure it.','new/modern/up-to-date The factory has some of the most up-to-date equipment available.','military equipment The sale of military equipment to the regime is banned.','medical equipment life-saving medical equipment','electrical/electronic equipment The store sells a wide range of electrical equipment.','computer/video/stereo etc equipment Ageing computer equipment should be replaced, not upgraded.','essential/necessary/vital equipment A compass is essential equipment when hiking.','standard equipment (= the equipment that is in a car, which does not cost extra to have ) Standard equipment on this model includes airbags, climate control and cruise control.','special equipment You don’t need any special equipment, just a pair of running shoes.','office equipment office equipment, such as photocopiers and printers','heavy equipment The truck has to be able to carry tanks and other heavy equipment.','safety/protective equipment Employers must provide safety equipment, and make sure it is used.','sporting/camping/skiing etc equipment Can you help me load the camping equipment into the boot, please?','use equipment Mr Gomez will now demonstrate how to use the equipment safely.','provide/supply equipment a contract to supply drilling equipment to the mine','install equipment We are installing new computerized equipment in place of the old machines.','need/require equipment For scuba diving, you’ll need specialized equipment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a shop selling camping equipment","translation":"یک مغازه فروش تجهیزات کمپینگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501564.mp3"},{"sentence":"some brand new computer equipment","translation":"تعدادی تجهیزات کامپیوتری کاملاً جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642274.mp3"},{"sentence":"a very useful piece of equipment","translation":"یک قطعه بسیار مفید از تجهیزات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501567.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you got your tennis stuff ?","translation":"آیا وسایل تنیس خود را دارید؟","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The laboratory has all the latest equipment.","translation":"این آزمایشگاه دارای آخرین تجهیزات می باشد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"All our equipment has been carefully tested.","translation":"تمام تجهیزات ما به دقت آزمایش شده است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"A good compass is an essential piece of equipment when you are hiking.","translation":"یک قطب نما خوب یکی از تجهیزات ضروری هنگام پیاده روی است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('10db0966-6382-5b72-8dee-4b80c2489e9c','1638eab4-1fd6-598b-b4d9-3564fb94a5bb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of equipping someone or something','[ singular ]',null,'فرآیند تجهیز کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a piece of equipment When you buy an expensive piece of equipment, you need to insure it.','new/modern/up-to-date The factory has some of the most up-to-date equipment available.','military equipment The sale of military equipment to the regime is banned.','medical equipment life-saving medical equipment','electrical/electronic equipment The store sells a wide range of electrical equipment.','computer/video/stereo etc equipment Ageing computer equipment should be replaced, not upgraded.','essential/necessary/vital equipment A compass is essential equipment when hiking.','standard equipment (= the equipment that is in a car, which does not cost extra to have ) Standard equipment on this model includes airbags, climate control and cruise control.','special equipment You don’t need any special equipment, just a pair of running shoes.','office equipment office equipment, such as photocopiers and printers','heavy equipment The truck has to be able to carry tanks and other heavy equipment.','safety/protective equipment Employers must provide safety equipment, and make sure it is used.','sporting/camping/skiing etc equipment Can you help me load the camping equipment into the boot, please?','use equipment Mr Gomez will now demonstrate how to use the equipment safely.','provide/supply equipment a contract to supply drilling equipment to the mine','install equipment We are installing new computerized equipment in place of the old machines.','need/require equipment For scuba diving, you’ll need specialized equipment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"A lot of money was spent on the equipment of the new hospital.","translation":"هزینه زیادی برای تجهیزات بیمارستان جدید هزینه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642275.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('904081cb-1031-5316-b0f9-90139f610499','ac77238c-7a19-5b3f-bc7b-40501288dc98',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely important and necessary',null,null,'بنیادی، اساسی، ضروری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['essential information You can get essential travel information from the website.','essential reading The journal is essential reading for doctors.','essential services (= organizations such as the police or the fire or health service ) The law prohibits workers in essential services from striking.','absolutely/really essential It is absolutely essential to keep this information secret.','be seen/regarded as essential These measures are seen as essential for national security.','be considered/deemed essential During the summer, air conditioning is considered essential.','play/perform an essential role in something Antibiotics play an essential role in controlling infection.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"A good diet is essential for everyone.","translation":"یک رژیم غذایی خوب برای همه ضروری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219177.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is essential that our pilots be given the best possible training.","translation":"ضروری است که خلبانان ما بهترین آموزش های ممکن را ببینند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00315.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is essential to book in advance.","translation":"رزرو از قبل ضروری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219183.mp3"},{"sentence":"Window locks are fairly cheap and absolutely essential .","translation":"قفل های پنجره نسبتاً ارزان و کاملاً ضروری هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614552.mp3"},{"sentence":"Even in small companies, computers are an essential tool.","translation":"حتی در شرکت های کوچک، کامپیوترها ابزاری ضروری هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614556.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('806c1de2-87ad-5484-8ac6-d8e0892cb96e','ac77238c-7a19-5b3f-bc7b-40501288dc98',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the essential part, quality, or feature of something is the most basic one',null,null,'بخش اساسی، کیفیت یا ویژگی یک چیزی اساسی ترین آن است',array['fundamental']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The essential difference between Sam and me was the fact that I took life seriously.","translation":"تفاوت اساسی بین من و سام این بود که زندگی را جدی می گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219190.mp3"},{"sentence":"The essential point of relay racing is that it is a team effort.","translation":"نکته اساسی مسابقه رله این است که یک تلاش تیمی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614560.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('277902e3-96f5-5efc-b493-a7a1b7beccd0','d439bf83-e84e-5e69-9736-d2a5c74e3e3a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is necessary to do something or in a particular situation','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'چیزی که برای انجام کاری یا در موقعیتی خاص ضروری است',array['necessity']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She packed a few essentials.","translation":"او چند مورد ضروری را بسته بندی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219200.mp3"},{"sentence":"We only had the bare essentials (= the most necessary things ) .","translation":"ما فقط چیزهای ضروری (= ضروری ترین چیزها) را داشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219204.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('23571e51-a60b-57c2-ade3-2fc50cd5cb6c','d439bf83-e84e-5e69-9736-d2a5c74e3e3a',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the essentials',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f68ba5cf-d931-57f9-bff6-c5e151b463ff','5241cc36-6821-5a1c-b798-1228196f7b80',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to start a company, organization , system, etc that is intended to exist or continue for a long time',null,null,'تأسیس کردن، بنیان‌گذاری کردن؛ مستقر کردن (نظر)',array['found']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The city of Boerne was established by German settlers in the 1840s.","translation":"شهر بوئرن توسط مهاجران آلمانی در دهه 1840 تأسیس شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219299.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our goal is to establish a new research centre in the North.","translation":"هدف ما ایجاد یک مرکز تحقیقاتی جدید در شمال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614574.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company was set up in 1976.","translation":"این شرکت در سال 1976 تاسیس شد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('1aef3214-68cb-56fd-9857-f336076446d0','5241cc36-6821-5a1c-b798-1228196f7b80',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to begin a relationship with someone or a situation that will continue',null,null,'برای شروع رابطه با کسی یا موقعیتی که ادامه خواهد داشت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hungary established diplomatic relations with Chile in 1990.","translation":"مجارستان در سال 1990 با شیلی روابط دیپلماتیک برقرار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614579.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wondered why he should bother to try and establish contact with me.","translation":"تعجب کردم که چرا او باید تلاش کند و با من ارتباط برقرار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614580.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('06b2066d-bd08-5c4b-9dcd-78d72e60491e','5241cc36-6821-5a1c-b798-1228196f7b80',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to find out facts that will prove that something is true',null,null,'برای کشف حقایقی که ثابت کند چیزی درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police must establish the facts of the case before proceeding.","translation":"پلیس قبل از اقدام باید حقایق پرونده را مشخص کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219303.mp3"},{"sentence":"The autopsy established that he had been murdered.","translation":"کالبد شکافی نشان داد که او به قتل رسیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219306.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was never able to establish whether she was telling the truth.","translation":"من هرگز نتوانستم ثابت کنم که آیا او حقیقت را می گوید یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614585.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6d34f684-1ed9-571b-a777-6ba9d21a0948','5241cc36-6821-5a1c-b798-1228196f7b80',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to make people accept that you can do something, or that you have a particular quality',null,null,'برای اینکه مردم بپذیرند که شما می توانید کاری را انجام دهید یا کیفیت خاصی دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He had three years in which to establish himself as prime minister.","translation":"او سه سال فرصت داشت تا خود را به عنوان نخست وزیر معرفی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219315.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’d already begun to establish quite a reputation as a journalist.","translation":"او قبلاً به عنوان یک روزنامه نگار شروع به ایجاد شهرت کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2d7f624c-81dd-5e21-88bf-cf464a877fd3','ac38f1f6-87a5-5df5-a22c-a3f672c46e15',1,null,null,'spoken & written','everyone',null,null,'همه (اشخاص)، همه کس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8a637361-bd8c-5e28-8962-4c1c8facb133','9df2aa47-0fd6-5487-8e3c-ba73af027c1c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely good or of very high quality',null,null,'عالی، بسیار خوب؛ آبرومند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an excellent suggestion","translation":"یک پیشنهاد عالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000536.mp3"},{"sentence":"His car is in excellent condition.","translation":"ماشینش عالیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001226313.mp3"},{"sentence":"Second-hand computers can be excellent value.","translation":"کامپیوترهای دست دوم می توانند ارزش بسیار خوبی داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734979.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ec411757-dee4-5791-9731-4b60a7377517','9df2aa47-0fd6-5487-8e3c-ba73af027c1c',2,null,null,'spoken','said when you approve of something',null,null,'گفت وقتی چیزی را تایید می کنی',array['great']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘I’ll bring the books over tonight.’ ‘Excellent.’","translation":"«من کتاب‌ها را امشب می‌آورم.» «عالی.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734986.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2607164f-07bd-594b-92d9-c5a08bae610b','735a7de2-2fc0-54c7-afb2-567656089113',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something or someone that is not included in a general statement or does not follow a rule or pattern',null,null,'استثنا؛ اعتراض (بیرون از قاعده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an important/significant exception The treaty was ratified by all the EU member countries, with one significant exception, Britain.','a major exception (= very important ) The major exception to the general downturn, the tourism sector, has actually seen an increase in profits.','a notable exception (= one that is very interesting, excellent or unusual ) The houses along the river are all relatively modern, with the notable exception of the old forge.','an obvious exception The earliest historical records, with the obvious exception of Chinese, are written in Indo-European languages.','a conspicuous exception (= one that is very easy to notice ) With one conspicuous exception, Ayers Rock, the desert landscape is completely flat.','a minor exception (= not important ) Everyone was in agreement, with a few minor exceptions.','a single/sole exception (= one on its own ) All the men were killed, with the sole exception of Captain Jones.','a rare exception Books on philosophy can be quite dull, but this is a rare exception.','with the exception of The journey was fairly straightforward, with the exception of driving through London.','without exception Without exception, all the children were well behaved and polite.','be no exception The river floods every winter, and this year was no exception.','be the exception to the rule ( also be the exception that proves the rule ) (= be different to most other people or things ) Most of the boys were quite shy, but Larry was the exception to the rule.','be the exception, not the rule (= used to emphasize that something is unusual ) Staying married for life seems to be the exception, not the rule these days.','make an exception (= deal with someone or something in a different way from usual on a particular occasion ) We usually require a 10% deposit, but I''ll make an exception in this case.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s been cold, but today’s an exception.","translation":"هوا سرد بود، اما امروز یک استثناست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735014.mp3"},{"sentence":"We all laughed, with the exception of Maggie.","translation":"همه خندیدیم، به استثنای مگی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735017.mp3"},{"sentence":"Each plant, without exception, contains some kind of salt.","translation":"هر گیاه، بدون استثنا، حاوی نوعی نمک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735020.mp3"},{"sentence":"With one or two notable exceptions , there are few women conductors.","translation":"به جز یکی دو استثنای قابل توجه، تعداد کمی از رهبران زن وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001226435.mp3"},{"sentence":"With a few minor exceptions, the new edition is much like the previous one.","translation":"با چند استثناء جزئی، نسخه جدید بسیار شبیه نسخه قبلی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735028.mp3"},{"sentence":"The law applies to all EU countries; Britain is no exception .","translation":"این قانون برای همه کشورهای اتحادیه اروپا اعمال می شود. بریتانیا نیز از این قاعده مستثنی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001226439.mp3"},{"sentence":"We don’t usually accept checks, but for you we’ll make an exception (= not include you in this rule ) .","translation":"ما معمولاً چک نمی‌پذیریم، اما برای شما استثنا قائل می‌شویم (= شما را در این قانون لحاظ نمی‌کنیم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735032.mp3"},{"sentence":"The spelling of this word is an interesting exception to the rule .","translation":"املای این کلمه استثنای جالبی از قاعده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001226445.mp3"},{"sentence":"Successful two-career couples are still the exception, not the rule (= used to emphasize that something is unusual ) .","translation":"زوج‌های موفق دو شغله هنوز استثنا هستند، نه یک قاعده (= برای تأکید بر غیرعادی بودن چیزی استفاده می‌شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735040.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('47f80ff0-80c3-5bf2-a9c4-f647c54ca994','735a7de2-2fc0-54c7-afb2-567656089113',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'somebody/something is the exception that proves the rule','استثنا؛ اعتراض (بیرون از قاعده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an important/significant exception The treaty was ratified by all the EU member countries, with one significant exception, Britain.','a major exception (= very important ) The major exception to the general downturn, the tourism sector, has actually seen an increase in profits.','a notable exception (= one that is very interesting, excellent or unusual ) The houses along the river are all relatively modern, with the notable exception of the old forge.','an obvious exception The earliest historical records, with the obvious exception of Chinese, are written in Indo-European languages.','a conspicuous exception (= one that is very easy to notice ) With one conspicuous exception, Ayers Rock, the desert landscape is completely flat.','a minor exception (= not important ) Everyone was in agreement, with a few minor exceptions.','a single/sole exception (= one on its own ) All the men were killed, with the sole exception of Captain Jones.','a rare exception Books on philosophy can be quite dull, but this is a rare exception.','with the exception of The journey was fairly straightforward, with the exception of driving through London.','without exception Without exception, all the children were well behaved and polite.','be no exception The river floods every winter, and this year was no exception.','be the exception to the rule ( also be the exception that proves the rule ) (= be different to most other people or things ) Most of the boys were quite shy, but Larry was the exception to the rule.','be the exception, not the rule (= used to emphasize that something is unusual ) Staying married for life seems to be the exception, not the rule these days.','make an exception (= deal with someone or something in a different way from usual on a particular occasion ) We usually require a 10% deposit, but I''ll make an exception in this case.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e35f8d84-e48e-5795-ba43-529e42557104','735a7de2-2fc0-54c7-afb2-567656089113',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'take exception to something','استثنا؛ اعتراض (بیرون از قاعده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an important/significant exception The treaty was ratified by all the EU member countries, with one significant exception, Britain.','a major exception (= very important ) The major exception to the general downturn, the tourism sector, has actually seen an increase in profits.','a notable exception (= one that is very interesting, excellent or unusual ) The houses along the river are all relatively modern, with the notable exception of the old forge.','an obvious exception The earliest historical records, with the obvious exception of Chinese, are written in Indo-European languages.','a conspicuous exception (= one that is very easy to notice ) With one conspicuous exception, Ayers Rock, the desert landscape is completely flat.','a minor exception (= not important ) Everyone was in agreement, with a few minor exceptions.','a single/sole exception (= one on its own ) All the men were killed, with the sole exception of Captain Jones.','a rare exception Books on philosophy can be quite dull, but this is a rare exception.','with the exception of The journey was fairly straightforward, with the exception of driving through London.','without exception Without exception, all the children were well behaved and polite.','be no exception The river floods every winter, and this year was no exception.','be the exception to the rule ( also be the exception that proves the rule ) (= be different to most other people or things ) Most of the boys were quite shy, but Larry was the exception to the rule.','be the exception, not the rule (= used to emphasize that something is unusual ) Staying married for life seems to be the exception, not the rule these days.','make an exception (= deal with someone or something in a different way from usual on a particular occasion ) We usually require a 10% deposit, but I''ll make an exception in this case.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('14ba2295-263c-5d23-b0de-057fbc7bfd1b','2b329491-cc36-5ef0-ad56-a2e77c0fd783',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a manager in an organization or company who helps make important decisions',null,'Chief Executive','مدیر ارشد، رئیس (شرکت)؛ قوه مجریه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a marketing executive","translation":"یک مدیر بازاریابی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228364.mp3"},{"sentence":"top executives on high salaries","translation":"مدیران ارشد با حقوق بالا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611754.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b0c58042-0c1b-54f4-a393-6da8c330e298','2b329491-cc36-5ef0-ad56-a2e77c0fd783',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the executive','مدیر ارشد، رئیس (شرکت)؛ قوه مجریه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6ca436ba-690d-507b-bc6e-48760811f5cc','2b329491-cc36-5ef0-ad56-a2e77c0fd783',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people who are in charge of an organization and make the rules',null,null,'گروهی از افراد که مسئول یک سازمان هستند و قوانین را وضع می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the union’s executive","translation":"مجری اتحادیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228380.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dd052c90-5f7e-56e0-a244-4dadb0a120f8','dbacebb4-edbb-576e-b6c7-b7f94c3aa1c4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to the job of managing a business or organization and making decisions',null,null,'اجرایی، مدیریتی (پست)؛ (شرکت) بنگاهی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a commission with executive powers","translation":"کمیسیونی با اختیارات اجرایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611759.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d1f35b95-05a6-5caa-85af-3afc2ebde48c','dbacebb4-edbb-576e-b6c7-b7f94c3aa1c4',2,null,null,'spoken & written','for the use of people who have important jobs in a company',null,null,'برای استفاده افرادی که مشاغل مهمی در یک شرکت دارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the executive dining-room","translation":"اتاق ناهار خوری اجرایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228398.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('249bde62-3228-501f-b2de-fc394fab6c64','dbacebb4-edbb-576e-b6c7-b7f94c3aa1c4',3,null,null,'spoken & written','expensive and designed for people who earn a lot of money',null,null,'گران قیمت و برای افرادی که درآمد زیادی کسب می کنند طراحی شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"executive toys (= objects to play with at work )","translation":"اسباب بازی های اجرایی (= اشیایی برای بازی در محل کار)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832205.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('be42340c-8185-58ae-9cb9-8d105f89e5fb','88ed9f40-8b1b-54a3-9e43-86dc05e3b358',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the state of existing','[ uncountable ]',null,'وجود، هستی؛ موجودیت؛ گذران (زندگی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['come into existence (= start to exist ) Pakistan came into existence as an independent country in 1947.','spring into existence (= suddenly start to exist ) After the invasion, a French resistance movement sprang into existence.','bring something into existence formal (= make something start to exist ) The state must follow the terms of the treaty that brought it into existence.','go out of existence (= stop existing ) If a buyer isn''t found, this famous old club could go out of existence.','acknowledge/recognize/accept the existence of something (= agree that something exists ) They organization finally acknowledged the existence of a problem.','prove/confirm/establish the existence of something (= prove that something exists ) The images confirm the existence of water on the planet''s surface.','deny the existence of something (= say that something does not exists ) He strongly denied the existence of God.','doubt the existence of something (= not believe that something exists ) Some people doubt the existence of life at the very bottom of the ocean.','jeopardize/threaten the existence of something (= make it likely that something will stop existing ) The strike could jeopardize the existence of his company.','owe your existence to something (= be able to exist because of something ) The birds owe their existence to the fact that there are no natural predators on the island.','brief/short The band had rather a brief existence. The show''s existence was extremely short.','human existence Darwin''s theory of natural selection changed our view of human existence forever.','something''s very existence The university''s very existence is at stake.','something''s actual existence Poaching now threatens the animal''s actual existence.','something''s continued existence The city''s continued existence is threatened by rising water levels.','something''s mere existence (= just the fact that something exists ) The mere existence of a contract does not guarantee that you will be paid.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It is impossible to prove the existence of God.","translation":"اثبات وجود خدا غیرممکن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001230612.mp3"},{"sentence":"The organization has been in existence for 25 years.","translation":"این سازمان 25 سال است که وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611946.mp3"},{"sentence":"Scientists have many theories about how the universe first came into existence (= started to exist ) .","translation":"دانشمندان نظریه های زیادی در مورد چگونگی پیدایش جهان برای اولین بار (= شروع به وجود) دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611947.mp3"},{"sentence":"The very existence of the museum is threatened by lack of funding.","translation":"وجود موزه به دلیل کمبود بودجه در خطر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611951.mp3"},{"sentence":"the continued existence of economic inequalities","translation":"ادامه وجود نابرابری های اقتصادی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611955.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a0812231-b13c-5c46-8c61-b3dc2d6b6493','88ed9f40-8b1b-54a3-9e43-86dc05e3b358',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the type of life that someone has, especially when it is bad or unhappy','[ countable usually singular ]','eke out a living/existence','نوع زندگی که یک فرد دارد، به خصوص زمانی که بد یا ناراضی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Pablo led a miserable existence when he first moved to San Juan.","translation":"پابلو زمانی که برای اولین بار به سن خوان نقل مکان کرد زندگی بدی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001230626.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8eca45d7-c5d0-54ef-87ae-21caba1a5277','9e585c23-e521-59c0-80f8-3bda3d91b295',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when something increases in size , range , amount etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'گسترش، توسعه؛ انبساط؛ پیشنهاد (توسعه)',array['growth']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big expansion Last year saw a big expansion at the company.','a great/huge/massive expansion (= very big ) There are plans for a massive expansion of the oil and gas industries.','a major/significant expansion (= large and important ) The company is planning a major expansion of its retail outlets.','a rapid expansion During the 1990s, there was a rapid expansion in student numbers.','a steady expansion There has been a steady expansion of the self-employed sector of the economy.','further expansion Investors think the hotel chain is ripe for further expansion.','economic expansion Economic expansion in India and China is set to continue.','business/commercial expansion These new measures could limit business expansion.','urban expansion We are seeing uncontrolled urban expansion in many African cities.','expansion takes place ( also expansion occurs formal ) The biggest expansion occurred in the volume of small issue government bonds.','an expansion plan The city’s ambitious expansion plans will require major investment.','an expansion programme Such an aggressive expansion programme could double the business in five years.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The rapid expansion of cities can cause social and economic problems.","translation":"گسترش سریع شهرها می تواند مشکلات اجتماعی و اقتصادی ایجاد کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612037.mp3"},{"sentence":"an expansion in student numbers","translation":"افزایش تعداد دانشجویان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612043.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2d0a69c5-dd91-524c-8e15-c8fa171f3da3','9e585c23-e521-59c0-80f8-3bda3d91b295',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when a company , business etc becomes larger by opening new shops , factories etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که یک شرکت، تجارت و غیره با افتتاح مغازه ها، کارخانه ها و غیره جدید بزرگتر می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big expansion Last year saw a big expansion at the company.','a great/huge/massive expansion (= very big ) There are plans for a massive expansion of the oil and gas industries.','a major/significant expansion (= large and important ) The company is planning a major expansion of its retail outlets.','a rapid expansion During the 1990s, there was a rapid expansion in student numbers.','a steady expansion There has been a steady expansion of the self-employed sector of the economy.','further expansion Investors think the hotel chain is ripe for further expansion.','economic expansion Economic expansion in India and China is set to continue.','business/commercial expansion These new measures could limit business expansion.','urban expansion We are seeing uncontrolled urban expansion in many African cities.','expansion takes place ( also expansion occurs formal ) The biggest expansion occurred in the volume of small issue government bonds.','an expansion plan The city’s ambitious expansion plans will require major investment.','an expansion programme Such an aggressive expansion programme could double the business in five years.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The industry underwent a period of rapid expansion .","translation":"این صنعت دوره ای از گسترش سریع را پشت سر گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001231853.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('008792c1-d735-5c39-be6a-4e3961dd9b44','9e585c23-e521-59c0-80f8-3bda3d91b295',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an idea , story etc that is based on one that is simpler or more general','[ countable ]',null,'یک ایده، داستان و غیره که بر اساس ایده ای ساده تر یا کلی تر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The novel is an expansion of a short story he wrote about forty years ago.","translation":"این رمان بسط داستان کوتاهی است که او حدود چهل سال پیش نوشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001231858.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ededd203-705e-544c-96f1-763f52dbddbb','1e2c282d-2380-5106-98da-6bd243b07b3a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','costing a lot of money',null,null,'گران، پرهزینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['quite/fairly expensive The food’s quite expensive, but it’s really nice.','rather/pretty expensive (= more expensive than you expect ) I think £1000 for a bed is rather expensive.','very/extremely expensive We ate at a very expensive restaurant.','astronomically/phenomenally expensive (= used to emphasize how expensive something is ) Some new medical treatments are phenomenally expensive.','hugely expensive (= extremely expensive, especially when you think something is too expensive ) The building is hugely expensive to maintain.','ridiculously/outrageously/horrendously expensive (= extremely expensive, in a way that seems shocking ) Room service in the hotel was ridiculously expensive.','extortionately expensive (= extremely expensive, in a way that is not fair or reasonable ) Houses in some parts of London are extortionately expensive.','prohibitively expensive formal (= too expensive, with the result that most people cannot afford to buy something ) HIV medicines are still prohibitively expensive for sufferers in Africa.','look expensive All of her clothes look very expensive.','prove expensive Their decision could prove expensive.','expensive tastes (= a desire to have things that are very expensive ) His wife has very expensive tastes and his kids always want the latest things.','an expensive mistake (= a mistake which results in someone having to spend a lot of money ) Choosing the wrong builder turned out to be an expensive mistake.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the most expensive restaurant in town","translation":"گران ترین رستوران شهر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653796.mp3"},{"sentence":"Petrol is becoming more and more expensive.","translation":"بنزین روز به روز گران می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233236.mp3"},{"sentence":"Photography is an expensive hobby.","translation":"عکاسی یک سرگرمی گران قیمت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233235.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house was too big and expensive to run.","translation":"خانه برای اداره آن خیلی بزرگ و گران بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233239.mp3"},{"sentence":"For low-income families, children’s safety equipment can be prohibitively expensive (= so expensive that most people cannot afford it ) .","translation":"برای خانواده‌های کم درآمد، تجهیزات ایمنی کودکان می‌تواند بسیار گران باشد (= آنقدر گران است که اکثر مردم توانایی خرید آن را ندارند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653797.mp3"},{"sentence":"Employing the wrong builder can be a horribly expensive mistake .","translation":"استخدام سازنده اشتباه می تواند یک اشتباه وحشتناک گران باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653798.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her husband had expensive tastes (= liked expensive things ) .","translation":"شوهرش ذوق گرانی داشت (= چیزهای گران قیمت را دوست داشت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001981194.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('5918b4a6-836f-5e2d-b6aa-22cabbd06e0f','262e0cbf-8cc3-5c9f-829b-c751086c2fcf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a loud sound and the energy produced by something such as a bomb bursting into small pieces','[ countable ]',null,'انفجار، ترکش؛ افزایش انفجاری (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big explosion There has been a big explosion in the centre of Paris.','a huge/massive/enormous explosion An enormous explosion tore the roof off the building.','a tremendous explosion (= very big and powerful ) The torpedo struck the side of the ship, followed by a tremendous explosion.','a powerful explosion The powerful explosion was heard from Portland, Maine to Albany, New York.','a major explosion formal We are getting reports of a major explosion at the oil refinery.','a loud explosion We heard several loud explosions followed by an eerie silence.','a deafening explosion (= extremely loud ) The building collapsed in a deafening explosion.','an almighty explosion old-fashioned (= extremely loud ) There was an almighty explosion and I was knocked to the ground.','a muffled explosion (= one that is not heard very clearly ) We could just make out a muffled explosion from deep inside the mine.','a nuclear/atomic explosion This is the site of the first ever nuclear explosion.','a gas explosion Firefighters say that a gas explosion destroyed the building.','a volcanic explosion (= one caused by a volcano ) You could see where a volcanic explosion had blown the mountain peak away.','cause an explosion The police do not yet know what caused the explosion.','set off/trigger an explosion (= cause an explosion ) Investigators believe a fuel leak may have triggered the explosion.','carry out an explosion (= cause one deliberately ) By 1942, the United States had carried out test explosions with nuclear bombs.','hear an explosion Marie was reading in bed when she heard the explosion.','an explosion takes place/happens The largest explosion took place at the main post office.','an explosion occurs formal The explosion occurred just off the coast of Greece.','an explosion shakes something A series of explosions shook the building.','an explosion destroys something Seven people died when the explosion destroyed the bus.','an explosion kills somebody Last year, an underground explosion killed 82 miners.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Several people were injured in a bomb explosion.","translation":"بر اثر انفجار بمب چندین نفر زخمی شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657633.mp3"},{"sentence":"We heard a loud explosion .","translation":"صدای انفجار مهیبی را شنیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657639.mp3"},{"sentence":"A massive explosion ripped through the building.","translation":"یک انفجار مهیب در ساختمان رخ داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657645.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
