main post office.','an explosion occurs formal The explosion occurred just off the coast of Greece.','an explosion shakes something A series of explosions shook the building.','an explosion destroys something Seven people died when the explosion destroyed the bus.','an explosion kills somebody Last year, an underground explosion killed 82 miners.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police carried out a controlled explosion of the device.","translation":"پلیس یک انفجار کنترل شده این دستگاه را انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001198772.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
